		"&fComplete every regional Mega Stone quest by finding &eone stone from each group&r&f."
		""
		"&7This is an optional one-time collection milestone. Individual stones remain optional collectibles."
	]
	quest.4B7A6E5D3C2F1908.quest_subtitle: "&7One Mega Stone from every regional group"
	quest.4B7A6E5D3C2F1908.title: "&dRegional Mega Stone Sampler&r"
	quest.4BA4F6184E332E92.quest_desc: [
		"&fThe moment has arrived to unlock the pinnacle of Starlight metallurgy."
		""
		"&bThe Unrealium Recipe:&f Load the &eAlloy Furnace&f with:&r"
		"&e1. Deepsilver Ingot&f (Purity and Agility)"
		"&e2. Golem Steel Ingot&f (Indestructible Structure)"
		"&e3. Malarite&f (Binding Density)"
		"&e4. Soul Dew&f (Spiritual Catalyst)"
		""
		"&aKeep the furnace chilled with Glacite coolant&f to smelt the mythical &5Unrealium Ingot&f! You now command the strongest material in the dimension."
	]
	quest.4BA4F6184E332E92.quest_subtitle: "&7The pinnacle metal of the cosmos"
	quest.4BA4F6184E332E92.title: "&5The Fourfold Fusion: Unrealium"
	quest.4BA6B9119C560B4A.quest_desc: [
		"&fShaping the Decaying Relic into a scythe yields the &bMagiscythe&f. Sweeps across vast arcs, shredding magic barriers and cleaving through hordes."
