	quest.4CCAE3E7FB8E1492.quest_desc: [
		"&fA spectral claymore found resting in soul-drenched tombs or coaxed from a &eContained Remnant&f on soul fire. In its slumbering state, its dark soul-rending abilities lie completely dormant."
		""
