	quest.4CE4AA2259D20E14.quest_desc: [
		"&fA bloodstone medallion that beats in rhythm with a warrior's heart."
		""
		"&fProc effect: Chaining melee attacks builds into a state of &cPhysical Trance&f, drastically boosting melee damage, attack speed, and movement."
