	]
	quest.4F5E0E16CB39278E.quest_subtitle: "&7Catch Mewtwo"
	quest.4F5E0E16CB39278E.title: "&dMewtwo"
	quest.4FE54C91901C1EB1.quest_desc: [
		"&fBy reforging the Dormant Relic to &bLevel 4&f under cover of midnight, the void corrupts the steel into the &5Tainted Relic&f."
		""
		"&fBestows the &bAbyssal Standard&f: attacks sap enemy strength, inflicting debilitating weakness with each hit."
	]
	quest.4FE54C91901C1EB1.quest_subtitle: "&7Corrupted at midnight at Awakening Level 4"
	quest.4FE54C91901C1EB1.title: "&5Tainted Relic"
	quest.4FE5776C54A78CA1.quest_desc: [
		"&fThe pinnacle of enchanted polearms. Heavy chops and spear points amplified by runic incantations."
	]
	quest.4FE5776C54A78CA1.quest_subtitle: "&7Heavy poleaxe augmented with arcane power"
	quest.4FE5776C54A78CA1.title: "&dRunic Halberd"
	quest.501F2B5E9BC9A6E3.quest_desc: [
		"&fCraft an &eIce and Fire Bestiary&f from &e3 Manuscripts&f, then obtain another Manuscript for future research."
		"&fPlace the Bestiary on an &bIce and Fire Lectern&f with Manuscripts to unlock chapters about creatures, taming, combat and materials."
	]
	quest.501F2B5E9BC9A6E3.quest_subtitle: "&7Codifying the monstrous unknown"
	quest.501F2B5E9BC9A6E3.title: "&6The Scholar's Bestiary"
	quest.507518777C14EB2B.quest_desc: [
		"&fEngineered by the Devon Corporation, the &bPokéNav&f provides dynamic terrain-scanning sonar for wild Pokémon."
		""
		"&eRight-clicking&f the PokéNav opens a radar HUD display showing all wild species actively spawned around your coordinates, their elevation, distance, and current spawning density."
		""
		"&fThe base casing can be customized with dyes into over a dozen vibrant palettes, including special &6Gholdengo&f and &dWanderer&f editions."
	]
	quest.507518777C14EB2B.quest_subtitle: "&7Advanced Terrestrial Sonar"
	quest.507518777C14EB2B.title: "&bDevon Radar: The PokéNav"
	quest.50A18B50284AE345.quest_desc: [
		"&fIf you lose the &aquest book &fit can always be opened from the top left of your inventory."
		"&fDifferent chapters of the quest book guide you through different mods in the modpack. I recommend starting in &dStorage Solutions &fand find out how to create a backpack."
	]
	quest.50A18B50284AE345.quest_subtitle: "So much reading..."
	quest.50A18B50284AE345.title: "&6The Quest Book"
	quest.50BF22C6846CDC63.quest_desc: [
		"&fObtain &eany one max cuisine variant&r&f from this category."
		""
		"&7One example completes the lesson. The remaining variants are optional collectibles."
	]
	quest.50BF22C6846CDC63.quest_subtitle: "&7Obtain any one max cuisine variant"
	quest.50BF22C6846CDC63.title: "&5Max Cuisine Variants"
	quest.50C4D11D4FAE97FA.quest_desc: [
		"&fTwo essential utilities make managing sophisticated storage blocks an effortless craft:"
		""
		"&f• &6Storage Tool&f: Shift-right click to switch modes. Allows locking drawer slots, toggling item count labels, cycling display borders, and linking containers."
		"&f• &ePacking Tape&f: Right-click a chest, barrel, or drawer to seal it with tape. Breaking the container preserves all stored contents, allowing full crates to be relocated anywhere!"
		""
		"&aSuper Packing Tape provides permanent sealing across multiple moves until manually peeled.&f"
	]
	quest.50C4D11D4FAE97FA.quest_subtitle: "&7Configuration tools and packaging tape"
	quest.50C4D11D4FAE97FA.title: "&6The Warehouse Foreman"
	quest.5148EF72A80F9FCF.quest_desc: [
		"&fWhen &5The Devourer&f consumes a dropped &eWhisperwind&f, the delicate wind blade is corrupted into the horrifying &4Dreadwhisper&f!"
		""
		"&fCommands terrors from the void, driving enemies into mad flight while tearing through armor with abyssal cleaves."
	]
	quest.5148EF72A80F9FCF.quest_subtitle: "&7Whisperwind corrupted by The Devourer's abyss"
	quest.5148EF72A80F9FCF.title: "&4Dreadwhisper"
	quest.515C83333A04B486.quest_desc: [
		"&fWelcome to the world of &6Ice and Fire&f, an untamed land dominated by creatures of ancient myth."
		""
		"&fHere, the sky belongs to apex predators whose fiery, frosty, or electrified breath can incinerate entire villages in minutes. Beneath the earth slumber titans older than civilization itself."
		""
		"&bSurvival demands knowledge.&f Careless wanderers will be snatched by amphitheres, hypnotized by sirens, turned to solid stone by gorgons, or burned to ash by flying terrors."
		""
		"&aFollow this chronicle step by step.&f Learn the weaknesses of mythological beasts, scavenge draconic carcasses, hatch your own winged ally, and harness the lost art of the &eDragon Forge&f."
	]
	quest.515C83333A04B486.quest_subtitle: "&7Here be dragons, titans, and forgotten horrors"
	quest.515C83333A04B486.title: "&6The Untamed World"
	quest.51702B3368C88E05.quest_desc: [
		"&fLootr containers generate personal contents for each player."
		"&aOpening one does not empty that same container for everyone else, so group exploration stays fair."
	]
	quest.51702B3368C88E05.quest_subtitle: "Explore with friends!"
	quest.51702B3368C88E05.title: "&6Lootr: Personal Container Loot"
	quest.518EC2C8AD93112B.quest_desc: [
		"&fRegister &e40 Ghost-type Pokémon&r&f in your Pokédex."
		""
		"&7Dual-type Pokémon count when Ghost is one of their types."
	]
	quest.518EC2C8AD93112B.quest_subtitle: "&7Register 40 Ghost-type Pokémon"
	quest.518EC2C8AD93112B.title: "&6Ghost Mastery&r"
	quest.51A9BF99AA2D0F19.quest_desc: [
		"&aAprijuice&f increases the riding stats of pokemon. Speed, Stamina, Acceleration, etc."
	]
	quest.51A9BF99AA2D0F19.quest_subtitle: "Obtain any Aprijuice."
	quest.51A9BF99AA2D0F19.title: "&dAprijuice Flavors"
	quest.51F2CA87028FD9F1.quest_desc: [
		"&fAt the stormy open roof of the Dark Tower hovers the titanic &cUr-Ghast&f, surrounded by a horde of miniature Carminite Ghastlings."
		""
		"&bThe Ghast Traps:&f"
		"&f• Across the roof platform are multiple &eGhast Traps&f powered by redstone."
		"&f• Slay wandering Ghastlings near the trap until the trap emits a charging sound and particles."
		"&f• When the Ur-Ghast flies overhead, step onto the pressure plate to unleash a massive electrical pulse, pulling the titan down and inflicting devastating damage!"
		"&f• Beware when it begins raining fiery tears—take shelter under cover immediately."
		""
		"&aVictory yields Fiery Tears, Carminite, and the Ur-Ghast Trophy!&f"
	]
	quest.51F2CA87028FD9F1.quest_subtitle: "&7Reign of the Carminite Spire"
	quest.51F2CA87028FD9F1.title: "&cThe Weeping Sky-Titan: Ur-Ghast"
	quest.522127129B06AC31.quest_desc: [
		"&fObtain one &eRunic Simply More weapon&f. Its upgrade path uses the corresponding Netherite weapon, a &eRunic Tablet&f and the addition shown in EMI."
		"&fUpgrade a weapon you already enjoy. The quest accepts the addon's runic styles as alternatives; it does not require a complete arsenal."
	]
	quest.522127129B06AC31.quest_subtitle: "&7A focused upgrade for the style you enjoy."
	quest.522127129B06AC31.title: "&aA Runic Addon Weapon"
	quest.53133DAECD6EAA13.quest_desc: [
		"&fHanging beneath the branches of the Echoing Forest are glowing bulbous clusters of &eSculk Gleam&f."
		""
		"&fUsing &bShears&f on &ePorous Sculk Gleam&f extracts sticky &eGleam Gel&f without destroying the bulb."
		""
		"&fGleam Gel can be crafted into bouncy Gleam Gel Blocks and serves as the favorite treat required to tame &3Sculk Snappers&f."
	]
	quest.53133DAECD6EAA13.quest_subtitle: "&7Shearing Porous Sculk Gleam"
	quest.53133DAECD6EAA13.title: "&eBioluminescent Dew"
	quest.5336132F3CA70A43.quest_desc: [
		"&fHold the &e~ &fwhile breaking a block to mine a group of blocks at the same time."
		"Hold &e~&f + &eShift&f and &eScroll up/down&f to change the shape you are mining in."
		"&cUltimine consumes tool durability and hunger."
	]
	quest.5336132F3CA70A43.quest_subtitle: "Mine it all"
	quest.5336132F3CA70A43.title: "&cFTB Ultimine"
	quest.53B1FCA83F6CAE89.quest_desc: [
		"&fCatch &dKyurem&f to add this rare Pokémon to your legendary field record."
		"&7The capture task completes automatically."
	]
	quest.53B1FCA83F6CAE89.quest_subtitle: "&7Catch Kyurem"
	quest.53B1FCA83F6CAE89.title: "&dKyurem"
	quest.53EA61E8B8EB6E1B.quest_desc: [
		"&fCatch &dPhione&f to add this rare Pokémon to your legendary field record."
		"&7The capture task completes automatically."
	]
	quest.53EA61E8B8EB6E1B.quest_subtitle: "&7Catch Phione"
	quest.53EA61E8B8EB6E1B.title: "&dPhione"
	quest.53F548179EA1C601.quest_desc: [
		"&fA delicate charm etched with flowing wind runes."
		""
		"&fEquipping this relic provides passive &bEvasion Chance&f, giving incoming physical and projectile attacks an outright chance to miss you completely."
		""
		"&fIndispensable for &eRogue&f and light-armor builds that rely on reflexes and dodging rather than tanking heavy blows."
	]
	quest.53F548179EA1C601.quest_subtitle: "&bThe Art of the Untouchable"
	quest.53F548179EA1C601.title: "&fLesser Evasion"
	quest.542385150D328C60.quest_desc: [
		"&fThe runic greataxe melds devastating laceration bleed with a rolled runic ability. Few creatures survive more than two cleaves."
	]
	quest.542385150D328C60.quest_subtitle: "&7Enchanted cleaving war-axe with bleeding strikes"
	quest.542385150D328C60.title: "&dRunic Greataxe"
	quest.54863AF1072E5E59.quest_desc: [
		"&fCatch &dJirachi&f to add this rare Pokémon to your legendary field record."
		"&7The capture task completes automatically."
	]
	quest.54863AF1072E5E59.quest_subtitle: "&7Catch Jirachi"
	quest.54863AF1072E5E59.title: "&dJirachi"
	quest.54B3AACD5B649891.quest_desc: [
		"&fA brutal dwarven warhammer charm."
		""
		"&fPerk mechanic: Heavy melee strikes possess a chance to &eStun / Daze&f enemies, interrupting spellcasting and attacks."
		""
		"&fEssential for controlling dangerous elite mobs, preventing them from casting deadly area abilities."
	]
	quest.54B3AACD5B649891.quest_subtitle: "&eConcussive Strikes"
	quest.54B3AACD5B649891.title: "&dGreater Perk: Skull Crusher"
	quest.54FB498F46A95407.quest_desc: [
		"&fCulinary mastery begins with raw preparation. The &eCutting Board&f is your multi-purpose workstation for filleting catches, slicing meats into cuts, and chopping wild produce into recipe components."
		""
		"&fEquipping a &eKnife&f also changes how you forage in the wild. Breaking wild grasses yields &bStraw&f, and defeating animals with a knife yields guaranteed bonus materials and secondary cuts."
		""
		"&aTip:&f Place an ingredient on the board with &bright-click&f, then interact with your knife in hand to slice it."
	]
	quest.54FB498F46A95407.quest_subtitle: "&7The cornerstone of ingredient preparation"
	quest.54FB498F46A95407.title: "&eKitchen Prep: Cutting Board and Knife"
	quest.556D0617CD7FCF13.quest_desc: [
		"&fRegister &e30 Fighting-type Pokémon&r&f in your Pokédex."
		""
		"&7Dual-type Pokémon count when Fighting is one of their types."
	]
	quest.556D0617CD7FCF13.quest_subtitle: "&7Register 30 Fighting-type Pokémon"
	quest.556D0617CD7FCF13.title: "&6Fighting Mastery&r"
	quest.5593E15BE3BE6CBE.quest_desc: [
		"&fA cosmic halberd that pulls down falling meteorites during combat. Sweeps fracture the ground with astral fire."
	]
	quest.5593E15BE3BE6CBE.quest_subtitle: "&7Halberd raining down shooting stars upon impact"
	quest.5593E15BE3BE6CBE.title: "&dStar's Edge"
	quest.55C0E66BE9A3DC83.quest_desc: [
		"&fChoose your starter with &eH&f and send it out with &eR&f. "
	]
	quest.55C0E66BE9A3DC83.quest_subtitle: "THERE IS SO MANY"
	quest.55C0E66BE9A3DC83.title: "&bChoose Your First Partner"
	quest.55DC01F1BF2DF384.quest_desc: [
		"&fRegister &e70 Grass-type Pokémon&r&f in your Pokédex."
		""
		"&7Dual-type Pokémon count when Grass is one of their types."
	]
	quest.55DC01F1BF2DF384.quest_subtitle: "&7Register 70 Grass-type Pokémon"
	quest.55DC01F1BF2DF384.title: "&6Grass Mastery&r"
	quest.560461A3F608A747.quest_desc: [
		"&fThe original trio of prehistoric species first synthesized on Cinnabar Island:"
		""
		"&e• Helix Fossil&f: The spiraled shell of &bOmanyte&f, the primordial Rock/Water cephalopod evolving into spiked Omastar."
		"&e• Dome Fossil&f: The armored carapace of &bKabuto&f, an ancient predatory horseshoe crab evolving into scythe-bearing Kabutops."
		"&e• Old Amber&f: Fossilized sap preserving the bloodline of &bAerodactyl&f, the vicious apex pterosaur of the prehistoric skies!"
		""
		"&aRecover all three Kanto specimens!&f"
	]
	quest.560461A3F608A747.quest_subtitle: "&7Helix, Dome, and Old Amber"
	quest.560461A3F608A747.title: "&6Kanto Pioneers: The Sea and Sky"
	quest.56B88C373ABBCD5E.quest_desc: [
		"&fWhen &dThe Watcher&f is awakened to &bLevel 4 or higher&f, reforging it at a &dRunic Forge placed in the Deep Dark&f corrupts it into &5The Devourer&f!"
		""
		"&fAttacks open abyssal maws that drag nearby enemies into crushing gravity wells. Furthermore, dropping specific weapons near its ravenous mass corrupts them into unique variations!"
	]
	quest.56B88C373ABBCD5E.quest_subtitle: "&7Reforged in the Deep Dark — A ravenous abyssal singularity"
	quest.56B88C373ABBCD5E.title: "&5★ The Devourer"
	quest.56BDE069E49CEDF1.quest_desc: [
		"&fCatch &dZekrom&f to add this rare Pokémon to your legendary field record."
		"&7The capture task completes automatically."
	]
	quest.56BDE069E49CEDF1.quest_subtitle: "&7Catch Zekrom"
	quest.56BDE069E49CEDF1.title: "&dZekrom"
	quest.56F7204419CBFBF9.quest_desc: [
		"&fIn this world, eating well is not merely a matter of stopping your hunger bar from shaking. Through the &eFood Book&f, every unique, nutritious dish you sample contributes toward permanent vitality milestones."
		""
		"&bSpice of Life: Carrot Edition&f rewards culinary exploration. Tasting distinct qualifying foods gradually awards bonus maximum health that persists even through death."
		""
		"&aTip:&f A food item must generally restore at least &b1 hunger point&f to register in your dietary catalog. Simple zero-nutrition tonics still offer tactical combat utility, but complex prepared meals are what will build your health pool."
	]
	quest.56F7204419CBFBF9.quest_subtitle: "&7Varied diets, growing vitality"
	quest.56F7204419CBFBF9.title: "&eWhy Cook? The Food Book"
	quest.5713296C1FBBD649.quest_desc: [
		"&fCatch &dHoopa&f to add this rare Pokémon to your legendary field record."
		"&7The capture task completes automatically."
	]
	quest.5713296C1FBBD649.quest_subtitle: "&7Catch Hoopa"
	quest.5713296C1FBBD649.title: "&dHoopa"
	quest.573C23C1959B21D2.quest_desc: [
		"&fAmid the towering columns of the &8Overcast Columns&f biome reside bizarre animate clay constructs known as Overcast Pots."
		""
		"&fThey come in three distinct growth stages: the diminutive &7Sorrow Pot&f, the larger &5Fear Pot&f, and the massive &cAnger Pot&f. As they grow in size, their health and defensive tenacity scale dramatically."
		""
		"&fDestroying them yields mystical &eGloomsherds&f—ancient fragments imbued with sculk iconography."
	]
	quest.573C23C1959B21D2.quest_subtitle: "&7Break the animated Overcast Pots"
	quest.573C23C1959B21D2.title: "&5Gloomsherds"
	quest.573C350DF46D835F.quest_desc: [
		"&fHigh among the canopy of &eCradlewood&f trees, graceful &eStarfire Birds&f build delicate nests harboring glowing &eStarfire Bird Eggs&f."
		""
		"&fRetrieve an egg and place it inside a crafted &eStarfire Bird Aviary&f. Once hatched and nurtured with native berries, your resident avians will periodically reward you with rare celestial feathers, gifts, and fiery smithing templates!"
	]
	quest.573C350DF46D835F.quest_subtitle: "&7Celestial avians in the boughs"
	quest.573C350DF46D835F.title: "&eThe Starfire Bird"
	quest.574B2F7E474F34A8.quest_desc: [
		"&fDeep within the second level of the Labyrinth resides the &cMinoshroom&f, an enraged fungal minotaur trapped in an ironwood cage."
		""
		"&bCombat:&f The Minoshroom charges with tremendous force and swings a lethal Diamond Minotaur Axe. Keep your distance, strafe around obstacles, and strike following its charges."
		""
		"&aKey Progression Drop:&f Slaying the Minoshroom rewards &eMeef Stroganoff&f. Consuming this magical stew permanently acclaims your body to searing heat, &cgranting immunity to the burning curse of the Fire Swamp!&f"
	]
	quest.574B2F7E474F34A8.quest_subtitle: "&7Guardian of the second maze tier"
	quest.574B2F7E474F34A8.title: "&cThe Bull of the Depths: Minoshroom"
	quest.57AC1E33FAE63428.quest_desc: [
		"&fCatch &dCelebi&f to add this rare Pokémon to your legendary field record."
		"&7The capture task completes automatically."
	]
	quest.57AC1E33FAE63428.quest_subtitle: "&7Catch Celebi"
	quest.57AC1E33FAE63428.title: "&dCelebi"
	quest.57B652E2DEE7D7A8.quest_desc: [
		"&fDouble-bladed staff of runic steel. Accelerates in swing speed as momentum stacks, cascading runic procs at dizzying rates."
	]
	quest.57B652E2DEE7D7A8.quest_subtitle: "&7Double-ended staff building rapid runic cascades"
	quest.57B652E2DEE7D7A8.title: "&dRunic Twinblade"
	quest.57CF370C61903495.quest_desc: [
		"&fThe &eCooking Pot&f is the central machine for stewing, simmering, and assembling warm multi-ingredient dishes. To operate, it must sit directly above an active &bheat source&f."
		""
		"&fWhile open campfires and magma blocks function, the &eStove&f is the definitive kitchen hearth: it safely radiates heat upward without burning you and can simultaneously simmer up to six items on its cooktop."
		""
		"&bOperation:&f Place ingredients into the pot's six input slots and ensure an appropriate container (such as &eWooden Bowls&f) is available in the serving slot to receive the finished dish."
	]
	quest.57CF370C61903495.quest_subtitle: "&7Where real cooking takes place"
	quest.57CF370C61903495.title: "&eThe Hearth: Stove and Cooking Pot"
	quest.580D7B71D8F56413.quest_desc: [
		"&fAn ornate steel gear talisman designed for heavy defenders."
		""
		"&fPerk mechanic: Blocking a powerful blow resets shield disable penalties or defensive ability cooldowns."
		""
		"&fPrevents axe-wielding vindicators and brutes from neutralizing your defensive guard."
	]
	quest.580D7B71D8F56413.quest_subtitle: "&9Relentless Guard"
	quest.580D7B71D8F56413.title: "&dGreater Perk: Shield Rebound"
	quest.5842C8D77908C670.quest_desc: [
		"&fWithin huge hollow stone coves surrounded by sheep pens dwells the massive &cCyclops&f. Capable of crushing players in a single swing, it will grab you in its giant fist and chew you to pieces."
		""
		"&bThe Clever Ruse:&f Cyclopes are virtually blind to sheep. Wearing a full set of &eSheep Disguise Armor&f allows you to walk straight past the behemoth unnoticed!"
		""
		"&aCombat Vulnerability:&f Shooting an arrow directly into its solitary eye temporarily blinds and stuns the monster."
		""
		"&fSlaying a Cyclops grants the legendary &eCyclops Eye&f, which repels and panics mobs when held in your offhand."
	]
	quest.5842C8D77908C670.quest_subtitle: "&7Giant shepherd of the desolate coves"
	quest.5842C8D77908C670.title: "&cThe One-Eyed Colossus"
	quest.58478B8510FABE83.quest_desc: [
		"&fCatch &dEntei&f to add this rare Pokémon to your legendary field record."
		"&7The capture task completes automatically."
	]
	quest.58478B8510FABE83.quest_subtitle: "&7Catch Entei"
	quest.58478B8510FABE83.title: "&dEntei"
	quest.587F302C1A04E533.quest_desc: [
		"&fAn aerodynamic feather-etched bronze emblem."
		""
		"&fActive ability: Grants a temporary burst of &bMovement Speed&f and &bAttack Speed&f upon activation."
		""
		"&fIdeal for closing the gap against evasive archers, slipping past ambushes, or unleashing rapid weapon combos before the enemy can react."
	]
	quest.587F302C1A04E533.quest_subtitle: "&bSwift as the Tempest"
	quest.587F302C1A04E533.title: "&fLesser Relic of Dexterity"
	quest.58856CE004662212.quest_desc: [
		"&fTo bind Resonarium Plates onto equipment at a Smithing Table, you require the &6Resonarium Upgrade Smithing Template&f."
		""
		"&fThese templates can be discovered inside loot chests in Ancient Temples and ruins across The Otherside, and duplicated using diamonds and stone like other smithing templates."
	]
	quest.58856CE004662212.quest_subtitle: "&7Find the smithing template"
	quest.58856CE004662212.title: "&6Resonarium Upgrade"
	quest.589C4375CDDF235D.quest_desc: [
		"&fCrafted at a crafting table combining the &dHeart of the Deep&f, &b2 Soul Crystals&f, and &e2 Sculk Bones&f."
		""
		"&bThe Sonic Boom:&f Hold right-click to channel acoustic energy into the staff. As you charge, the staff emits a rising frequency and glows golden at maximum charge (up to 128 ticks)."
		""
		"&fRelease to unleash a concentrated sonic projectile dealing up to &c50 armor-piercing damage&f across 15 blocks, piercing through shields and defensive barriers alike!"
	]
	quest.589C4375CDDF235D.quest_subtitle: "&7Channel a focused sonic boom"
	quest.589C4375CDDF235D.title: "&bSonorous Staff"
	quest.599CBD8D3DBBE0EF.quest_desc: [
		"&fRegister &e50 Poison-type Pokémon&r&f in your Pokédex."
		""
		"&7Dual-type Pokémon count when Poison is one of their types."
	]
	quest.599CBD8D3DBBE0EF.quest_subtitle: "&7Register 50 Poison-type Pokémon"
	quest.599CBD8D3DBBE0EF.title: "&6Poison Mastery&r"
	quest.59A5F3E519004B31.quest_desc: [
		"&fSearch the Nether with an &eEye of Monstrous&f. Explore the &eSoul Blacksmith&f and prepare your fire protection before approaching its guardian."
		"&fAllow room to avoid attacks and lava. Repair before entering rather than relying on a quick escape from the arena."
		"&aDefeat the boss to complete this milestone.&f"
	]
	quest.59A5F3E519004B31.quest_subtitle: "&7Soul Blacksmith"
	quest.59A5F3E519004B31.title: "&bNetherite Monstrosity"
	quest.59E63CFAB048A6A9.quest_desc: [
		"&fBeneath the snowcapped peaks of the Permafrost Forest lie frozen caverns housing the &bPermafrost&f titan."
		""
		"&fThis glacial monstrosity attacks with arctic frost breath and freezing spit capable of instantly hardening molten lava into obsidian. Equip Glacite armor to prevent frostbite and claim the &eFrozen Tube&f and &eColdsnap&f upon its demise."
	]
	quest.59E63CFAB048A6A9.quest_subtitle: "&7Confronting the Permafrost beast"
	quest.59E63CFAB048A6A9.title: "&bThe Chilled Deep"
	quest.59FB229E4F60D0A5.quest_desc: [
		"&fMeandering through crystalline valleys are eerie rivers of luminescent &bEther&f, flanked by blossoming clusters of yellow &eThioquartz&f."
		""
		"&fEther fluid acts as a cosmic chemical solvent: tossing certain items into it dissolves their impurities or catalyzes transmutation (such as transforming cracked weapons or music discs)."
		""
		"&aThioquartz shards can be synthesized into alchemical gear and explosive splitting arrows."
	]
	quest.59FB229E4F60D0A5.quest_subtitle: "&7The solvent of realities"
	quest.59FB229E4F60D0A5.title: "&9Rivers of Pure Ether"
	quest.5A0ACFAAB594AF44.quest_desc: [
		"&fGladiator crescent blades that strike twice per swing, delivering double instances of runic power procs."
	]
	quest.5A0ACFAAB594AF44.quest_subtitle: "&7Paired crescent blades unleashing twin runic strikes"
	quest.5A0ACFAAB594AF44.title: "&dRunic Warglaive"
	quest.5B2A0A47B07FF3B3.quest_desc: [
		"&fA searing flame-whip disguised as a blade. Sweeps unleash scorching lashing arcs that ignite multiple enemies at extended range."
	]
	quest.5B2A0A47B07FF3B3.quest_subtitle: "&7Fiery lashing sweeps that incinerate ranks"
	quest.5B2A0A47B07FF3B3.title: "&cEmberlash"
	quest.5B2DE40728BFDDE5.quest_desc: [
		"&fPrecision katana imbued with ancient runes. A roll of &bZephyr&f or &bMomentum&f turns this precision blade into an electric hurricane."
	]
	quest.5B2DE40728BFDDE5.quest_subtitle: "&7Critical-strike katana quickened by ancient symbols"
	quest.5B2DE40728BFDDE5.title: "&dRunic Katana"
	quest.5B760F0C10DFE721.quest_desc: [
		"&fPlace the &eFossil Analyzer&f down then place the &eData Monitor&f on top of it, afterwards place the &eRestoration Tank&f beside them both."
	]
	quest.5B760F0C10DFE721.quest_subtitle: "&7Cleaning Fossils"
	quest.5B760F0C10DFE721.title: "&bFossil Analyzer"
	quest.5B77E152004B28A8.quest_desc: [
		"&fCraft a &eTerracotta Hopper Botany Pot&f. Place a storage inventory beneath it and give the pot a valid soil and crop combination."
		"&fThe hopper version collects finished produce automatically. Check that the receiving inventory has space before adding more pots."
		"&aStart with one reliable crop and expand only when you need more output.&f"
	]
	quest.5B77E152004B28A8.quest_subtitle: "&7Route a hopper pot into storage."
	quest.5B77E152004B28A8.title: "&eCollect the Harvest"
	quest.5C07B83843CAD277.quest_desc: [
		"&fExploration of the lush &eStarlight Forest&f will uncover tranquil hydrothermal springs bordered by &eSpringstone&f and bubbling &eThermal Springstone&f."
		""
		"&fMining and refining this geothermal mineral yields &eThermal Springstone Ingots&f. Weapons and armor forged from Thermal Springstone scorch adversaries on contact and provide strong thermal shielding—especially effective against frost-aligned creatures."
	]
	quest.5C07B83843CAD277.quest_subtitle: "&7Harnessing geothermal fury"
	quest.5C07B83843CAD277.title: "&cScalding Mineral Springs"
	quest.5C545D7F81E9EB5C.quest_desc: [
		"&fRegister &e70 Flying-type Pokémon&r&f in your Pokédex."
		""
		"&7Dual-type Pokémon count when Flying is one of their types."
	]
	quest.5C545D7F81E9EB5C.quest_subtitle: "&7Register 70 Flying-type Pokémon"
	quest.5C545D7F81E9EB5C.title: "&6Flying Mastery&r"
	quest.5CD5014136DB2924.quest_desc: [
		"&fCatch &dEnamorus&f to add this rare Pokémon to your legendary field record."
		"&7The capture task completes automatically."
	]
	quest.5CD5014136DB2924.quest_subtitle: "&7Catch Enamorus"
	quest.5CD5014136DB2924.title: "&dEnamorus"
	quest.5CEC4EB5EDD96831.quest_desc: [
		"&fA featherweight eagle emblem carved from petrified wood."
		""
		"&fProc effect: Arrow impacts have a chance to proc a surge of &bRanged Damage&f for consecutive shots."
		""
		"&fIdeal for bow and crossbow users executing rapid sustained archery from high perches."
	]
	quest.5CEC4EB5EDD96831.quest_subtitle: "&eBallistic Mastery"
	quest.5CEC4EB5EDD96831.title: "&bMedium Sniper's Relic"
	quest.5D14E53B1CD670F6.quest_desc: [
		"&fCollect a &eDisplay Case&f and use it to exhibit an item from your travels, such as an evolution stone or fossil."
		"&fConfirm the display-case explanation after reading it. Pokemon Models are not needed to complete this display project."
	]
	quest.5D14E53B1CD670F6.quest_subtitle: "&7Trophies of a Master's Journey"
	quest.5D14E53B1CD670F6.title: "&6Trainer's Showcase: Display Cases"
	quest.5D3A20B71B782977.quest_desc: [
		"&fEvery standard weapon in &eSimply Swords&f rolls an innate &bImplicit Ability&f when crafted. Hold &bAlt&f while inspecting any weapon in your inventory to see its exact rolled strength."
		""
		"&eImplicit Disciplines:&f"
		"• &bClaymore / Longsword:&f Deflection (chance to negate damage)"
		"• &bGreathammer / Hammer:&f Sundering (strips enemy armor)"
		"• &bGreataxe / Halberd / Glaive:&f Laceration (applies stacking Bleed)"
		"• &bSpear / Rapier:&f Piercing (ignores a percentage of armor)"
		"• &bKatana:&f Critical Edge (chance for double strike damage)"
		"• &bCutlass:&f Plunder (extra loot drop rolls)"
		"• &bSai / Dagger:&f Backstab (increased behind-the-back damage)"
		"• &bTwinblade / Chakram:&f Momentum (bonus attack speed on hit)"
		"• &bScythe:&f Execution (executes low-health foes)"
		"• &bWarglaive:&f Dual Flurry (strikes in rapid cadence)"
	]
	quest.5D3A20B71B782977.quest_subtitle: "&7Study the unique implicit traits of each weapon class"
	quest.5D3A20B71B782977.title: "&f✦ Weapon Implicits Guide"
	quest.5D41E75F17258903.quest_desc: [
		"&fCatch &dArceus&f to add this rare Pokémon to your legendary field record."
		"&7The capture task completes automatically."
	]
	quest.5D41E75F17258903.quest_subtitle: "&7Catch Arceus"
	quest.5D41E75F17258903.title: "&dArceus"
	quest.5D98DC1370E79C0B.quest_desc: [
		"&fRegister &e30 Fairy-type Pokémon&r&f in your Pokédex."
		""
		"&7Dual-type Pokémon count when Fairy is one of their types."
	]
	quest.5D98DC1370E79C0B.quest_subtitle: "&7Register 30 Fairy-type Pokémon"
	quest.5D98DC1370E79C0B.title: "&6Fairy Mastery&r"
	quest.5DC3513A2BF77500.quest_desc: [
		"&fWith Golem Steel ingots in abundance, forge the intimidating &eGolem Steel Greatsword&f and propulsion components like the &eGolem Steel Jet&f."
		""
		"&bNote on Oxidation:&f Untreated Golem Steel blocks and structures will gradually weather and oxidize over time unless waxed with honeycomb, mirroring the ancient ruins of the forge."
	]
	quest.5DC3513A2BF77500.quest_subtitle: "&7Heavy steel for heavy hands"
	quest.5DC3513A2BF77500.title: "&eMachined Metallurgy"
	quest.5DD887A9C4A573AE.quest_desc: [
		"&fWhile &bStormscale&f is awakened to &bLevel 4 or higher&f, reforging it at a Runic Forge &cduring an active thunderstorm&f transforms it into &bIonbound Stormscale&f!"
		""
		"&fPassively generates protective &bIon Cubes&f that nullify heavy incoming damage. On right-click, slams shut electrified forcefields to crush and paralyze entire battle lines."
	]
	quest.5DD887A9C4A573AE.quest_subtitle: "&7Reforged in a thunderstorm — Ion fields and lightning corridors"
	quest.5DD887A9C4A573AE.title: "&b★ Ionbound Stormscale"
	quest.5DDB9F07A1D27052.quest_desc: [
		"&fCatch &dChi-Yu&f to add this rare Pokémon to your legendary field record."
		"&7The capture task completes automatically."
	]
	quest.5DDB9F07A1D27052.quest_subtitle: "&7Catch Chi-Yu"
	quest.5DDB9F07A1D27052.title: "&dChi-Yu"
	quest.5DF8BDD6DFDF104E.quest_desc: [
		"&fAt &bAwakening Level 8&f, the Lichblade achieves its horrifying final form. It commands maximum base attack damage and unleashes devastating soul-leeching active attacks."
		""
		"&fFully awakened, the blade stands as one of the most formidable two-handed weapons in existence."
	]
	quest.5DF8BDD6DFDF104E.quest_subtitle: "&7Fully awakened at Level 8 — The Lich King's pride"
	quest.5DF8BDD6DFDF104E.title: "&d★ Awakened Lichblade"
	quest.5E0C0C7653536F63.quest_desc: [
		"&fZ-Moves convert a compatible move into a powerful special attack through the combination of a Trainer-side &eZ-Ring&f and an appropriate &eZ-Crystal&f."
		""
		"&fThe required path follows the system from discovering Z-Power to executing an actual Z-Move. Crystal and accessory collections remain optional."
	]
	quest.5E0C0C7653536F63.quest_subtitle: "&7A once-per-battle burst powered by Z-Rings and compatible Z-Crystals"
	quest.5E0C0C7653536F63.title: "&e✦ Z-Moves"
	quest.5EAA67DE6FB00E75.quest_desc: [
		"&fPushing storage to its maximum limits yields containers capable of supporting entire automation complexes."
		""
		"&f• &bDiamond Tier&f: 108 slots (double chest equivalent in a single 1x1 block) and 4 upgrade sockets."
		"&f• &5Netherite Tier&f: 120 slots, 5 upgrade sockets, blast-proof construction, and immunity to fire/lava."
		""
		"&aDeploy these when building high-speed mob farm drops or quarry output buffers.&f"
	]
	quest.5EAA67DE6FB00E75.quest_subtitle: "&7Diamond and Netherite fortresses for your loot"
	quest.5EAA67DE6FB00E75.title: "&bImpervious Vaults"
	quest.5F00E880B660706B.quest_desc: [
		"&fAn executioner's scythe augmented with runic potency. Slices through packs and executes wounded targets on contact."
	]
	quest.5F00E880B660706B.quest_subtitle: "&7Reaping scythe executing foes with arcane frost or fire"
	quest.5F00E880B660706B.title: "&dRunic Scythe"
	quest.5F178E66FD3C2873.quest_desc: [
		"&fStart with the &eWorn Notebook&f. It explains Ars Nouveau's machines, spell glyphs and magical creatures; keep it beside EMI when building your workshop."
		"&fThe left column introduces spellcraft. The middle column builds Source infrastructure. The right column offers practical uses and installed addons."
		"&7You do not need to collect every glyph or upgrade every accessory to make useful magic."
	]
	quest.5F178E66FD3C2873.quest_subtitle: "&7Your recipe and multiblock reference."
	quest.5F178E66FD3C2873.title: "&aThe Mage's Notebook"
	quest.5F35BE8AC580FD01.quest_desc: [
		"&eAncient Vases&f can be found resting silently on the dark cobblestone floors of Ancient Cities."
		""
		"&fSmashing these fragile urns can yield rare artifacts, experience, and valuable underworld materials. However, they can also be picked up carefully with &bSilk Touch&f."
		""
		"&cCaution:&f Some vases harbor lurking horrors. Breaking a vase has a chance to awaken aggressive &3Sculk Leeches&f or even an elusive &cStalker&f!"
	]
	quest.5F35BE8AC580FD01.quest_subtitle: "&7Treasures hidden within fragile clay"
	quest.5F35BE8AC580FD01.title: "&6Relics of the Fallen City"
	quest.5F8E9C2A4D1B7063.quest_desc: [
		"&fPresss &eH&f when you are ready to choose a starter. This is an information page, you do not need to read every entry before playing."
	]
	quest.5F8E9C2A4D1B7063.quest_subtitle: "Thank you for joining!"
	quest.5F8E9C2A4D1B7063.title: "&6Welcome to Cobblemon Unyielding"
	quest.5FBF3E26CAF1FFF2.quest_desc: [
		"&fCatch &dGroudon&f to add this rare Pokémon to your legendary field record."
		"&7The capture task completes automatically."
	]
	quest.5FBF3E26CAF1FFF2.quest_subtitle: "&7Catch Groudon"
	quest.5FBF3E26CAF1FFF2.title: "&dGroudon"
	quest.5FCFB653AEC59E55.quest_desc: [
		"&fObtain &eany one signature z-crystal from set ii&r&f from this category."
		""
		"&7One example completes the lesson. The remaining variants are optional collectibles."
	]
	quest.5FCFB653AEC59E55.quest_subtitle: "&7Obtain any one signature z-crystal from set ii"
	quest.5FCFB653AEC59E55.title: "&eSignature Z-Crystals II"
	quest.5FF2AA4EED69F00E.quest_desc: [
		"&fThis expedition covers &eSinnoh, Unova and Kalos&f in generation order."
		"&fConfirm this guide to unlock the capture records; related evolutionary families remain linked in sequence."
		"&7Dependency lines are hidden so the regional grid stays readable."
	]
	quest.5FF2AA4EED69F00E.quest_subtitle: "&7Sinnoh, Unova and Kalos field records"
	quest.5FF2AA4EED69F00E.title: "&cLegendary Expeditions: Sinnoh-Kalos"
	quest.5FFFEFD9F5CA6764.quest_desc: [
		"&fA towering two-handed greatsword. Slow to swing, but delivers monumental cleaving blows and commands substantial reach."
		""
		"&fLike the longsword, claymores possess the &bDeflection&f implicit, giving you a chance to turn aside lethal physical strikes while standing your ground."
	]
	quest.5FFFEFD9F5CA6764.quest_subtitle: "&7Massive two-handed cleaver with high deflection"
	quest.5FFFEFD9F5CA6764.title: "&fDiamond Claymore"
	quest.602664EB0A217C86.quest_desc: [
		"&fCatch &dLatias&f to add this rare Pokémon to your legendary field record."
		"&7The capture task completes automatically."
	]
	quest.602664EB0A217C86.quest_subtitle: "&7Catch Latias"
	quest.602664EB0A217C86.title: "&dLatias"
	quest.60533BE364DFE409.quest_desc: [
		"&fOut in the open sea, jagged rocky islets host deceptively beautiful maidens whose enchanting songs lure sailors toward the reefs. Step close enough, and their illusion shatters into hideous fanged merfolk!"
		""
		"&cMandatory Preparation:&f Never approach siren islands without wearing &eEarplugs&f crafted from wooden buttons. Earplugs deafen you to their hypnotic melody, preventing involuntary movement into deep water."
		""
		"&fSlain sirens yield &eSiren Tears&f, an essential catalyst for brewing aquatic medicines and crafting the hypnotic &eSiren Flute&f."
	]
	quest.60533BE364DFE409.quest_subtitle: "&7A melodious promise of a watery grave"
	quest.60533BE364DFE409.title: "&9The Lure of the Deep: Sirens"
	quest.6095B667EC4559EA.quest_desc: [
		"&fThe Otherside is colossal and disorienting. Locating its pinnacle structure—the &6Ancient Temple&f—requires specialized navigation."
		""
		"&fCombine &e4 Warden Carapaces&f with a vanilla &eCompass&f to construct the &6Ancient Compass&f."
		""
		"&bTracking:&f Within The Otherside, this needle will point directly to the nearest, undiscovered Ancient Temple."
	]
	quest.6095B667EC4559EA.quest_subtitle: "&7Track an Ancient Temple"
	quest.6095B667EC4559EA.title: "&6Ancient Compass"
	quest.613CD422C6BA3A47.quest_desc: [
		"&fCatch &dSolgaleo&f to add this rare Pokémon to your legendary field record."
		"&7The capture task completes automatically."
	]
	quest.613CD422C6BA3A47.quest_subtitle: "&7Catch Solgaleo"
	quest.613CD422C6BA3A47.title: "&dSolgaleo"
	quest.6140505A1259A418.quest_desc: [
		"&fWhen mining cobble, gravel, or building materials, even a 100-slot backpack can become clogged with full 64-item stacks."
		""
		"&eStack Upgrades&f fundamentally alter slot physics inside your pack:"
		"&f• &eStarter Tier&f: 2x vanilla stack limit (128 per slot)"
		"&f• &fTier 1&f: 4x vanilla stack limit (256 per slot)"
		"&f• &6Tier 2&f: 8x vanilla stack limit (512 per slot)"
		"&f• &bTier 3 and 4&f: 16x and 32x stack limits"
		""
		"&aEquipping just one Stack Upgrade turns a few spare slots into bottomless gravel pits.&f"
	]
	quest.6140505A1259A418.quest_subtitle: "&7Multiplying item limits per pocket"
	quest.6140505A1259A418.title: "&bDeep Pockets"
	quest.6148A146FBE43D0B.quest_desc: [
		"&fA mysterious, weathered longsword hatched from a &5Tampered Remnant&f or looted from end-tier boss encounters. Its true alignment is yet unwritten."
		""
		"&fIts destiny branches depending on the hour you choose to awaken it at the &dRunic Forge&f:"
		"• &eDaytime in the Overworld:&f Transforms into the holy &eRighteous Relic&f."
		"• &5Nighttime / Darkness:&f Corrupts into the abyssal &5Tainted Relic&f."
	]
	quest.6148A146FBE43D0B.quest_subtitle: "&7A blank canvas of destiny awaiting sun or shadow"
	quest.6148A146FBE43D0B.title: "&eDormant Relic"
	quest.614FF3D719DB3AD0.quest_desc: [
		"&fA smooth serpentine statue carved from primordial deep-forest jade."
		""
		"&fInfused with nature's pulse, boosting overall health resilience, natural regeneration, and druidic spells."
		""
		"&fGreatly strengthens sustain-focused playstyles and wilderness survival."
	]
	quest.614FF3D719DB3AD0.quest_subtitle: "&aThe Living Idol of Natural Harmony"
	quest.614FF3D719DB3AD0.title: "&aJade Jewel Figurine"
	quest.615C8FF12E1B08AA.quest_desc: [
		"&fCatch &dVolcanion&f to add this rare Pokémon to your legendary field record."
		"&7The capture task completes automatically."
	]
	quest.615C8FF12E1B08AA.quest_subtitle: "&7Catch Volcanion"
	quest.615C8FF12E1B08AA.title: "&dVolcanion"
	quest.61B4F4002952FF50.quest_desc: [
		"&fSay goodbye to checking twenty chests to find where you stored a single redstone comparator."
		""
		"&eTom's Simple Storage Mod&f provides modern, lightweight digital inventory indexing without requiring complex power setups or channel routing."
		""
		"&fThe &eInventory Connector&f is the beating heart of this system. Place it touching any collection of adjacent chests, barrels, or drawers. It automatically indexes the entire multiblock cluster into a single searchable network."
		""
		"&aAll adjacent containers form one master inventory!&f"
	]
	quest.61B4F4002952FF50.quest_subtitle: "&7Index every touching container into one network"
	quest.61B4F4002952FF50.title: "&fUnified Logistics"
	quest.622867D85C28F95C.quest_desc: [
		"&fAquatic ecosystems harbor vastly distinct Pokémon based on three environmental factors: &ewater biome&f, &etime of day/weather&f, and &erod tier (Old, Good, Super)&f."
		""
		"&fHolding the &bFishingNav&f while facing any river, ocean, or subterranean pool displays the exact catch table and probability rates for each rod type. Stop casting blindly for Feebas or Dratini!&f"
	]
	quest.622867D85C28F95C.quest_subtitle: "&7Reading the Hidden Depths"
	quest.622867D85C28F95C.title: "&bAngler's Sonar: FishingNav"
	quest.62510432B978745B.quest_desc: [
		"&fAcquire a &eSparkling Stone&f through the mod's progression."
		""
		"&fThis is the first major step toward the Trainer equipment used to channel Z-Power."
	]
	quest.62510432B978745B.quest_subtitle: "&7Discover the material that begins Z-Power progression"
	quest.62510432B978745B.title: "&eSparkling Stone"
	quest.627BA4A9684EC842.quest_desc: [
		"&fFeeding farm outputs into your network and extracting resources for automated machinery requires dedicated interfaces:"
		""
		"&f• &6Inventory Proxy&f: Exposes the entire network as a single virtual chest face. Connect your mob farm, quarry, or auto-smelter pipes here to deposit directly into the system."
		"&f• &bInventory Interface and Hopper&f: Extracts or inserts items along network cables with customizable item filters and redstone controls."
		""
		"&aA single Inventory Proxy replaces dozens of messy hopper lines.&f"
	]
	quest.627BA4A9684EC842.quest_subtitle: "&7Proxies and interfaces for external piping"
	quest.627BA4A9684EC842.title: "&6Automated Gateways"
	quest.62801C4510435A10.quest_desc: [
		"&fAn engraved copper hawk eye pendant."
		""
		"&fActive ability: Temporarily imbues your arrows with increased &bRanged Damage&f and enhanced projectile velocity."
		""
		"&fActivate during long-range archery volleys or rapid crossbow bursts to puncture armored targets from afar."
	]
	quest.62801C4510435A10.quest_subtitle: "&bDeadly Trajectory"
	quest.62801C4510435A10.title: "&fLesser Relic of the Marksman"
	quest.62A409513E20E848.quest_desc: [
		"&fRaw Gravitite cannot be smelted in a conventional furnace. To unlock its metallic potential, place Gravitite Ore into the &6Altar&f fueled with Ambrosium."
		""
		"&fThe altar purifies and activates the mineral, producing &5Enchanted Gravitite&f. This shimmering block is the ultimate crafting component for top-tier tools and high-altitude armor."
	]
	quest.62A409513E20E848.quest_subtitle: "&7Transmuting Raw Ore into Resonant Metal"
	quest.62A409513E20E848.title: "&5Levitating Metallurgy"
	quest.62BFFEFE1A43DE6F.quest_desc: [
		"&fConventional crops do not grow naturally in the eternal gloom of The Otherside."
		""
		"&fInstead, survivalists must forage &bBloom Berries&f from the cavern undergrowth. These provide an instant, renewable food source while exploring."
		""
		"&fSurrounding them are &eGlowing Roots&f and &eGlowing Grass&f, which emit ambient light and can be used to illuminate cavern paths."
	]
	quest.62BFFEFE1A43DE6F.quest_subtitle: "&7Bloom berries and radiant roots"
	quest.62BFFEFE1A43DE6F.title: "&bNourishment of the Abyss"
	quest.62EE43AE5B4E8496.quest_desc: [
		"&fAs you explore hills and riverbanks, look for giant exposed canopy roots. Breaking the tangled green &eRoot Strands&f yields &bLiveroots&f."
		""
		"&fCombine a &bLiveroot&f with an &eIron Ingot&f and a &eGold Nugget&f to create &6Raw Ironwood Materials&f, which smelt into &eIronwood Ingots&f."
		""
		"&aAll equipment crafted from Ironwood comes pre-enchanted&f with useful charms like Efficiency, Protection, or Unbreaking!"
	]
	quest.62EE43AE5B4E8496.quest_subtitle: "&7Wood infused with raw metallic virtue"
	quest.62EE43AE5B4E8496.title: "&6Treasures of the Roots: Ironwood"
	quest.63427C724FD4C4AD.quest_desc: [
		"&fCatch &dDarkrai&f to add this rare Pokémon to your legendary field record."
		"&7The capture task completes automatically."
	]
	quest.63427C724FD4C4AD.quest_subtitle: "&7Catch Darkrai"
	quest.63427C724FD4C4AD.title: "&dDarkrai"
	quest.63DF8E1A46F47F22.quest_desc: [
		"&fOres, ingots, redstone, and mob drops inevitably fill your vaults with raw pieces that are better stored as compact blocks."
		""
		"&fThe &eCompacting Upgrade&f acts as an automated 2x2 and 3x3 crafter inside the container:"
		"&f• Iron nuggets automatically compress into ingots, and ingots compress into blocks."
		"&f• In Limited Barrels, it displays all three forms simultaneously, allowing you to insert ingots and withdraw blocks or nuggets on demand!"
		""
		"&aAn absolute must-have for quarry drop points and iron farm outputs.&f"
	]
	quest.63DF8E1A46F47F22.quest_subtitle: "&7Automated 2x2 and 3x3 resource compression"
	quest.63DF8E1A46F47F22.title: "&eCompression Matrix"
	quest.6400597A2A59A10B.quest_desc: [
		"&fNot every culinary creation is a sit-down meal. Hand-crafted drinks provide rapid utility when exploring dangerous environments."
		""
		"&eHot Cocoa&f soothes the body and instantly &bclears one active harmful status effect&f without purging your beneficial buffs like a bucket of milk would."
		""
		"&eMelon Juice&f delivers a quick burst of refreshment alongside an &binstant health restoration&f, making it an ideal survival sip in mid-combat."
	]
	quest.6400597A2A59A10B.quest_subtitle: "&7Soothing draughts for hazardous journeys"
	quest.6400597A2A59A10B.title: "&eKitchen Apothecary: Recovery Tonics"
	quest.64C378D35CF0991C.quest_desc: [
		"&fA shadowy veil woven from mist and spider silk."
		""
		"&fProc effect: When under attack, has a chance to proc a substantial burst of &bEvasion&f."
		""
		"&fAllows squishy characters to slip through incoming barrage unscathed when surrounded."
	]
	quest.64C378D35CF0991C.quest_subtitle: "&7Smoke and Mirrors"
	quest.64C378D35CF0991C.title: "&bMedium Phantom Relic"
	quest.64DD39543D9A50F9.quest_desc: [
		"&fCatch &dMeltan&f to add this rare Pokémon to your legendary field record."
		"&7The capture task completes automatically."
	]
	quest.64DD39543D9A50F9.quest_subtitle: "&7Catch Meltan"
	quest.64DD39543D9A50F9.title: "&dMeltan"
	quest.654A0D01FA03457E.quest_desc: [
		"&aVitamins&f increase a pokemons EVs."
	]
	quest.654A0D01FA03457E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain one of every Vitamin"
	quest.654A0D01FA03457E.title: "&eVitamins"
	quest.65C02D7F8F1B8C20.quest_desc: [
		"&fA masterwork iron-crested buckler emblem."
		""
		"&fPerk mechanic: Successfully blocking an attack with your shield grants a massive stacking &9Defense&f buff."
		""
		"&fTurns tanky paladins and fighters into unbreakable walls of armor during boss encounters."
	]
	quest.65C02D7F8F1B8C20.quest_subtitle: "&9Impenetrable Bastion"
	quest.65C02D7F8F1B8C20.title: "&dGreater Perk: Fortress Stance"
	quest.65C990B4219D8BE8.quest_desc: [
		"&fFind one of these unique weapons: &eBlack Pearl, Timekeeper, Earthshatter, Tidebreaker, Grandfrost or The Pan&f. These are alternative discoveries, not a crafting order."
		"&fInspect your weapon's tooltip to learn its special effect and any activation conditions. Keep a dependable backup while learning an unfamiliar ability."
		"&7This optional collection is independent of your diamond and runic crafting route. Other unique weapons remain usable even if they are not part of this sample."
	]
	quest.65C990B4219D8BE8.quest_subtitle: "&7An optional sample of unique weapons."
	quest.65C990B4219D8BE8.title: "&aA Rare Find"
	quest.65ECC5E000658FB3.quest_desc: [
		"&fCraft a &eLoom Table&f from Chipped to create patterned wool, carpets and other textile variants."
		"&7Textiles provide color, rhythm and softer interior surfaces."
	]
	quest.65ECC5E000658FB3.quest_subtitle: "&7Weave wool and textile variants"
	quest.65ECC5E000658FB3.title: "&eThe Weaver's Loom&r"
	quest.6673DC63BE7A04BC.quest_desc: [
		"&fCatch &dXerneas&f to add this rare Pokémon to your legendary field record."
		"&7The capture task completes automatically."
	]
	quest.6673DC63BE7A04BC.quest_subtitle: "&7Catch Xerneas"
	quest.6673DC63BE7A04BC.title: "&dXerneas"
	quest.667AC17AFBFDB828.quest_desc: [
		"&fA razor-sharp aerodynamic disc. While dangerous in hand-to-hand combat, it excels when hurling momentum into clusters."
		""
		"&fShares the &bMomentum&f implicit: quick successive hits rapidly build attack speed to overwhelm targets."
	]
	quest.667AC17AFBFDB828.quest_subtitle: "&7Circular throwing ring accelerating on successive hits"
	quest.667AC17AFBFDB828.title: "&fDiamond Chakram"
	quest.66A8B4836A7F0AE5.quest_desc: [
		"&fWhy carry separate workbenches and furnaces into caves when your backpack can perform those jobs internally?"
		""
		"&f• &eCrafting Upgrade&f: Embeds a full 3x3 crafting grid into a tab on your pack."
		"&f• &6Smelting Upgrade&f: Cooks food or smelts ores using stored solid fuels."
		"&f• &cAuto-Smelting Upgrade&f: Smelts raw ores automatically as soon as they enter your pack!"
		""
		"&aCombining auto-pickup with auto-smelting means every raw iron block you mine is already an ingot before you surface.&f"
	]
	quest.66A8B4836A7F0AE5.quest_subtitle: "&7Crafting and smelting on the go"
	quest.66A8B4836A7F0AE5.title: "&eField Workshop"
	quest.66B96CF20790222F.quest_desc: [
		"&fComplete your exterior with &6Windows&r. Use &bBlinds&r and &bShutters&r to control light and privacy. "
		""
		"&fThese windows come in multiple 3D styles like &fGothic&r or &6Modern&r."
	]
	quest.66B96CF20790222F.quest_subtitle: "&7Add windows, shutters and blinds"
	quest.66B96CF20790222F.title: "&eSight and Shade&r"
	quest.673CE8E2E6D92D04.quest_desc: [
		"&fHiding completely submerged within sculk turf, the &cShriek Worm&f lies in ambush until a target steps within 4 blocks."
		""
		"&fWhen triggered, it shoots upward, screeching and snapping with ferocious kinetic impact."
		""
		"&fDefeating these burrowers yields a intact &eSculk Jaw&f, prized as a serrated weapon component."
	]
	quest.673CE8E2E6D92D04.quest_subtitle: "&7Extracting the razor jaw of the Shriek Worm"
	quest.673CE8E2E6D92D04.title: "&cSubsurface Mandibles"
	quest.6764065F71ECCA6B.quest_desc: [
		"&fA legendary relic of supreme martial leadership."
		""
		"&fActive ability: Establishes a majestic war zone that grants a massive &cPhysical Attack Damage&f boost to yourself and all nearby allies."
		""
		"&fThe definitive raid trinket for commanding parties during boss encounters."
	]
	quest.6764065F71ECCA6B.quest_subtitle: "&cArea of Unmatched Might"
	quest.6764065F71ECCA6B.title: "&6Superior War Banner"
	quest.6835F53106D94D27.quest_desc: [
		"&fAt the core of the sphere resides &6The Sun Spirit&f, an immortal deity of pure thermal energy."
		""
		"&cIMMUNITY MECHANIC:&f The Sun Spirit cannot be harmed by swords, bows, darts, or pickaxes! Striking his burning avatar directly is entirely futile."
		""
		"&bThe Deflection Strategy:&f"
		"&fDuring battle, the Sun Spirit casts volleys of scorching fire and crystalline &bIce Balls&f. You must stand firm and &bhit the ice projectiles with your weapon or fist&f to reflect them directly back into his fiery body!"
		""
		"&aEach reflected ice ball chills and extinguishes his core, dealing massive damage until he concedes defeat and surrenders the &6Gold Dungeon Key&f!"
	]
	quest.6835F53106D94D27.quest_subtitle: "&7Boss: The Sun Spirit"
	quest.6835F53106D94D27.title: "&6Confronting the Sun"
	quest.6835FB48E5531B94.quest_desc: [
		"&fBeneath the murky waters and packed mud of the &eDark Swamp&f lies &eDeepsilver Ore&f (formerly known as Swamp Silver)."
		""
		"&fDeepsilver ingots yield remarkably lightweight equipment tailored for agile combat. Wearing a full suit of Deepsilver armor grants active resistance against debilitating debuffs such as &cPoison, Nausea, and Slowness&f."
		""
		"&eDeepsilver&f also forms one of the four essential metal components required later to forge endgame &dUnrealium&f."
	]
	quest.6835FB48E5531B94.quest_subtitle: "&7Purifying ore of the lowlands"
	quest.6835FB48E5531B94.title: "&fSilver of the Dark Swamp"
	quest.688470F43F810C32.quest_desc: [
		"&fThe iconic handheld digital encyclopedia. Without a &bPokédex&f, a trainer journeys blind through the wilderness."
		""
		"&fHold the device in your main hand and &eright-click any wild Pokémon&f to scan its anatomical data directly into your personal database. Scanning records typing, stat distributions, habitat biomes, learnsets, and evolutionary pathways."
		""
		"&7Note: Crafting tables allow you to redye the Pokédex shell into black, blue, green, pink, white, or yellow!&f"
	]
	quest.688470F43F810C32.quest_subtitle: "&7Cataloging the Biodiversity of the Wild"
	quest.688470F43F810C32.title: "&bField Telemetry: The Pokédex"
	quest.68A31992FDDE9C44.quest_desc: [
		"&fObtain &eany one trainer z-ring style&r&f from this category."
		""
		"&7One example completes the lesson. The remaining variants are optional collectibles."
	]
	quest.68A31992FDDE9C44.quest_subtitle: "&7Obtain any one trainer z-ring style"
	quest.68A31992FDDE9C44.title: "&eTrainer Z-Power Rings"
	quest.6911FAFDAF7DCF82.quest_desc: [
		"&fObtain a &dMega Stone&f. Mega Stones are species-specific and determine which compatible Pokémon can access a Mega form."
		""
		"&fYou only need to understand the system for progression. The extensive regional stone collections below are optional completion goals."
	]
	quest.6911FAFDAF7DCF82.quest_subtitle: "&7The Pokémon-side requirement for a compatible Mega Evolution"
	quest.6911FAFDAF7DCF82.title: "&dMega Stone"
	quest.6932CA6CFD95EF03.quest_desc: [
		"&fCatch &dBuzzwole&f to add this rare Pokémon to your legendary field record."
		"&7The capture task completes automatically."
	]
	quest.6932CA6CFD95EF03.quest_subtitle: "&7Catch Buzzwole"
	quest.6932CA6CFD95EF03.title: "&dBuzzwole"
	quest.694060873B430FB9.quest_desc: [
		"&fAn ethereal twinblade forged from stellar remnants. Swings leave trails of stardust that illuminate and disintegrate creatures of darkness."
		""
		"&aDeterministic Creation:&f Offer a &eContained Remnant&f onto an &bEnd Portal Frame&f to draw forth this astral armament!"
	]
	quest.694060873B430FB9.quest_subtitle: "&7Astral twinblade drawing power from the cosmos"
	quest.694060873B430FB9.title: "&dCaelestis"
	quest.696614D67C9F5032.quest_desc: [
		"&fCatch &dNihilego&f to add this rare Pokémon to your legendary field record."
		"&7The capture task completes automatically."
	]
	quest.696614D67C9F5032.quest_subtitle: "&7Catch Nihilego"
	quest.696614D67C9F5032.title: "&dNihilego"
	quest.698E17F49802CAC4.quest_desc: [
		"&fForge one of the listed &eSimply More diamond weapons&f. Pick a style that complements your current gear rather than crafting all ten for a checklist."
		"&fEMI shows each shape's recipe. Read the finished weapon's tooltip and practice its range before using it in a boss encounter."
	]
	quest.698E17F49802CAC4.quest_subtitle: "&7One diamond weapon is enough."
	quest.698E17F49802CAC4.title: "&aForge an Additional Style"
	quest.69E6DCF3B6A8F0F8.quest_desc: [
		"&fDynamax temporarily enlarges a Pokémon and transforms its moves into &5Max Moves&f. Compatible Pokémon can instead access a species-specific &5Gigantamax&f form."
		""
		"&fThis branch is intentionally straightforward: unlock the equipment, use Dynamax, raise Dynamax Level, prepare Max Soup and finish with Gigantamax."
	]
	quest.69E6DCF3B6A8F0F8.quest_subtitle: "&7Galar's size-changing battle system and its specialized G-Max forms"
	quest.69E6DCF3B6A8F0F8.title: "&5✦ Dynamax and Gigantamax"
	quest.6A2F1E0B4D9C7B31.quest_desc: [
		"&6The Architect's Vision&r"
		""
		"&fWelcome, builder. This chapter is your guide to thousands of new blocks."
		""
		"&fYou will start with simple tools to alter textures on the fly, progress to massive specialized workbenches, and finally master structural components like sloped roofs and suspension bridges."
		""
		"&fThe left group explores &ematerials and finishes&f; the right group collects &econstruction tools and interior details&f. Choose the parts that suit your build."
		"&7The final portfolio still gathers all of the chapter's collection goals. Its lines are hidden to keep the material groups readable."
	]
	quest.6A2F1E0B4D9C7B31.quest_subtitle: "&7Choose a building discipline"
	quest.6A2F1E0B4D9C7B31.title: "&eThe Art of Decoration&r"
	quest.6A31A6F59416D7D2.quest_desc: [
		"&fObtained through a &5Tampered Remnant&f or slaying deep horrors, the &2Decaying Relic&f is a moss-covered staff dripping with primeval magical potential."
		""
		"&fPlacing the Decaying Relic into a &dRunic Forge&f allows you to guide its regrowth into one of three legendary &dMagi Armaments&f!"
	]
	quest.6A31A6F59416D7D2.quest_subtitle: "&7Ancient staff ready to blossom into magi weaponry"
	quest.6A31A6F59416D7D2.title: "&2Decaying Relic"
	quest.6A94EFC875131F5B.quest_desc: [
		"&fThe &3Blooming Caverns&f biome stands in stark contrast to the barren gloom, carpeted in lush Blooming Moss and towering turquoise fungal stalks."
		""
		"&eBlooming Stems&f can be stripped and milled into rich turquoise &bBloom Planks&f, offering yet another exotic building material exclusive to the dimension."
	]
	quest.6A94EFC875131F5B.quest_subtitle: "&7Harvest the turquoise undergrowth"
	quest.6A94EFC875131F5B.title: "&bBlooming Caverns"
	quest.6AC8FE33AB9EEC94.quest_desc: [
		"&fIn the amber-draped &eTorreya Forest&f, carefully stripping bark from Torreya logs using an axe has a high chance to yield glistening &eRaw Amaramber&f."
		""
		"&fSmelting raw resin produces &eAmaramber Ingots&f. When crafted into lanterns, candles, or sickle blades, Amaramber emits an aura that &cprevents monster spawning&f in a generous radius, making it ideal for fortifying outdoor pathways."
	]
	quest.6AC8FE33AB9EEC94.quest_subtitle: "&7Aromatic warding amber"
	quest.6AC8FE33AB9EEC94.title: "&6Resin of the Torreya"
	quest.6B7EC1A8F446CDBF.quest_desc: [
		"&fA brooding claymore adorned with unblinking eyes. Striking enemies stacks &bDread&f, summoning swarming bats that harry the target."
		""
		"&fOn right-click, unleashes a torrent of bats that executes foes below 25% health!"
	]
	quest.6B7EC1A8F446CDBF.quest_subtitle: "&7Summons dread swarms and executes wounded prey"
	quest.6B7EC1A8F446CDBF.title: "&dThe Watcher"
	quest.6BC747FAAA25A41F.quest_desc: [
		"&fCrafted with obsidian and a &dRunic Tablet&f, the &dRunic Forge&f is the ultimate workstation of &eSimply Swords&f."
		""
		"&fPlace any &eUnique Weapon&f into the forge along with additional Runic Tablets to increase its &bAwakening Level&f (up to level 8). As awakening climbs, attack damage scales to its true maximum and sealed passive or active powers awaken!"
		""
		"&fThe forge also handles &bgem socketing&f: inserting a weapon automatically displays and extracts any installed &dRunefused&f or &4Netherfused&f gems so they can be exchanged without destroying the armament."
	]
	quest.6BC747FAAA25A41F.quest_subtitle: "&7Awaken dormant legends and tune socketed gems"
	quest.6BC747FAAA25A41F.title: "&d★ The Runic Forge"
	quest.6BE5E68F55EDDE2D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 1 of every non-standard poke balls"
	quest.6BE5E68F55EDDE2D.title: "&cUnique Poke balls"
	quest.6BE60037307CD9AE.quest_desc: [
		"&fDual crescent blades connected by a central grip. Built for aggressive frontline gladiators."
		""
		"&fCarries the &bTwin Strike&f implicit: every swing delivers two rapid hits in one motion, shredding shields and mob swarms."
	]
	quest.6BE60037307CD9AE.quest_subtitle: "&7Paired crescent blades striking twice per swing"
	quest.6BE60037307CD9AE.title: "&fDiamond Warglaive"
	quest.6BE6393962638848.quest_desc: [
		"&fWhen you venture into &5The End&f carrying a &eContained Remnant&f alongside a &dRunic Tablet&f in your inventory, ender energies will gradually corrupt the capsule into a &5Tampered Remnant&f."
		""
		"&fOnce corrupted, the tampered remnant can only hatch into mysterious ancient relics: the &eDormant Relic&f, the elusive &5Enigma&f, or the moldering &2Decaying Relic&f!"
	]
	quest.6BE6393962638848.quest_subtitle: "&7Expose a contained remnant to the End with a runic tablet"
	quest.6BE6393962638848.title: "&5Tampered Remnant"
	quest.6BEA397DFCDA7261.quest_desc: [
		"&aIV Candy&f increases the Hyper-Trained IV's of a pokemon by 1 each. Buy them in the shop at spawn."
	]
	quest.6BEA397DFCDA7261.quest_subtitle: "Obtain one of every IV candy."
	quest.6BEA397DFCDA7261.title: "&aIV Candy"
	quest.6C0F1ACFFB125C26.quest_desc: [
		"&fUsing a &bSmithing Table&f with a &eNetherite Upgrade Template&f, coat your diamond weapon in heavy ancient debris to produce a &dNetherite Longsword&f."
		""
		"&fIn addition to raw damage, knockback resistance, and heatproofing, Netherite arms are an absolute requirement for higher mystic infusion: only Netherite weapons can accept the sacred runic inscriptions."
	]
	quest.6C0F1ACFFB125C26.quest_subtitle: "&7Forged in ancient subterranean fire"
	quest.6C0F1ACFFB125C26.title: "&fNetherite Reinforcement"
	quest.6C2F2D5E8533A654.quest_desc: [
		"&fDeep within the labyrinthine corridors of the Ancient Temple dwells the terrifying &4Stalker&f (also occasionally awoken by smashing Ancient Vases)."
		""
		"&fThe Stalker possesses formidable armor defense, rapid gap-closing movement, and merciless melee strikes."
		""
		"&fSlaying the Stalker yields the precious &bSoul Crystal&f—the ultimate acoustic focus required to craft the Sonorous Staff, Soul Elytra, and endgame alloys."
	]
	quest.6C2F2D5E8533A654.quest_subtitle: "&7Defeat the Stalker"
	quest.6C2F2D5E8533A654.title: "&3Soul Crystal"
	quest.6C3478BDDB5E583A.quest_desc: [
		"&fDragons are divided into three distinct elemental species, each governing distinct biomes:"
		""
		"&c• Fire Dragons:&f Found across temperate plains, hills, and deserts. Breathe explosive fire and turn terrain into charred stone."
		"&b• Ice Dragons:&f Dwell exclusively in frigid tundras, snowy peaks, and glaciers. Freeze targets solid into ice blocks."
		"&e• Lightning Dragons:&f Inhabit savannas, badlands, and jungles. Strike victims with concussive, paralyzing lightning bolts."
		""
		"&fDragons grow across &bFive Distinct Stages&f. Stages 1 through 3 hunt across surface roosts. Stages 4 and 5 are gargantuan ancient dragons slumbering deep underground."
		""
		"&aSexual Dimorphism:&f Males display distinct wing patterns and straight horns. Females feature plain, unpatterned wings and curved horns—and ONLY mature females drop Dragon Eggs!"
	]
	quest.6C3478BDDB5E583A.quest_subtitle: "&7Fire, Frost, and Lightning"
	quest.6C3478BDDB5E583A.title: "&6Ecology of the Great Wyrms"
	quest.6C36154378A693FE.quest_desc: [
		"&fNormal wooden shafts snap under draconic power. By carving dense &eDragon Bones&f, you can craft standard weapons and tools boasting durability and damage far exceeding diamond."
		""
		"&fThe &eDragonbone Bow&f draws further and strikes with significantly higher velocity than any vanilla bow."
		""
		"&aCraft a Dragonbone Sword and Dragonbone Bow to cement your status as an apex hunter.&f"
	]
	quest.6C36154378A693FE.quest_subtitle: "&7Harder than steel, lighter than obsidian"
	quest.6C36154378A693FE.title: "&6Dragonbone Armory"
	quest.6C3843153950EDEE.quest_desc: [
		"&fHarnessing residual dragon breath inside sealed bottles produces formidable tactical beverages."
		""
		"&eDragon Breath Soda&f empowers the drinker with &bStrength II&f and &bResistance I&f for &b1 full minute&f."
		""
		"&fThis makes it one of the most potent pre-combat buffs available from the kitchen, offering both devastating melee prowess and substantial damage mitigation for boss encounters."
	]
	quest.6C3843153950EDEE.quest_subtitle: "&7Empowering potions of the outer void"
	quest.6C3843153950EDEE.title: "&5Draconic Effervescence: Dragon Breath Soda"
	quest.6C51BEE295979C3B.quest_desc: [
		"&fUnearthed from the shifting sands and Mirage Tower remnants of the Hoenn desert:"
		""
		"&e• Root Fossil&f: The anchor root of &bLileep&f, a bizarre Rock/Grass sea-lily camouflage predator that evolves into the stalwart Cradily."
		"&e• Claw Fossil&f: The jagged appendage of &bAnorith&f, an anomalous anomalocarid sea predator evolving into the armored Armaldo."
		""
		"&aBoth organisms dominated the sea floor during the ancient Cambrian explosion.&f"
	]
	quest.6C51BEE295979C3B.quest_subtitle: "&7Root and Claw Fossils"
	quest.6C51BEE295979C3B.title: "&6Hoenn Primevals: The Cradle of the Deep"
	quest.6CD044A180E7006F.quest_desc: [
		"&fCapes and magical trinkets complete your aeronautical loadout."
		""
		"&b• Agility Cape:&f Grants accelerated sprinting and step-assist over single-block obstacles."
		"&6• Golden Feather:&f Negates all fall damage entirely while slowing downward descent to a controllable float."
		"&9• Iron Bubble:&f An aquatic relic that permits underwater breathing in sky cisterns without consuming oxygen."
	]
	quest.6CD044A180E7006F.quest_subtitle: "&7Kinetic Agility in High Altitude"
	quest.6CD044A180E7006F.title: "&6Capes and Aerial Feathers"
	quest.6CD61F0338AE3BDC.quest_desc: [
		"&fHidden in the deepest grimstone layers of the dimension is the coveted &bStarlit Diamond&f."
		""
		"&fSurpassing vanilla diamonds in both tensile strength and magical conductivity, Starlit Diamond gear delivers top-tier protection and formidable attack power. They are also vital for high-tier smithing and curio craftwork."
	]
	quest.6CD61F0338AE3BDC.quest_subtitle: "&7The peerless crystal of the deep"
	quest.6CD61F0338AE3BDC.title: "&bGems of the Firmament"
	quest.6D49581E29ACFA55.quest_desc: [
		"&fEvery self-respecting trainer needs a home outpost or wilderness outpost outfitted with two foundational machines:"
		""
		"&e1. Personal Computer (PC)&f: Access all 30+ storage boxes, manage battle teams, and inspect natures, IVs, and movesets in safety."
		""
		"&e2. Healing Machine&f: Right-click your party into the cradles to restore all HP, cure persistent status afflictions (&cPoison, Burn, Paralysis, Freeze, Sleep&f), and restore PP to maximum."
		""
		"&aPlace them at your home ranch or expedition hubs!&f"
	]
	quest.6D49581E29ACFA55.quest_subtitle: "&7The Cornerstones of Any Trainer Outpost"
	quest.6D49581E29ACFA55.title: "&aBase Infrastructure: PC and Healing Unit"
	quest.6D4DF8934C75BF90.quest_desc: [
		"&fZanite is a distinct purple crystalline deposit embedded within Holystone cliff faces, requiring a Holystone Pickaxe or better to mine."
		""
		"&fBreaking &dZanite Ore&f yields raw &dZanite Gemstones&f, eliminating the need for smelting. Zanite represents the backbone of mid-tier Aether survivability, enabling the fabrication of resilient armaments, accessories, and advanced workstations."
	]
	quest.6D4DF8934C75BF90.quest_subtitle: "&7The Iron of the Floating Islands"
	quest.6D4DF8934C75BF90.title: "&dPurple Luster"
	quest.6D74185981D07294.quest_desc: [
		"&fRuling the open oceans, colossal &3Sea Serpents&f breach above the waves to swallow entire boats and drag unwary swimmers into the abyss."
		""
		"&fEquipped with devastating jet-bursts of boiling bubbles and bite attacks that snap through standard diamond armor, defeating one requires careful boat kiting and long-range archery."
		""
		"&fLooting their corpse yields shimmering &eSea Serpent Scales&f and massive &eSea Serpent Fangs&f, foundational materials for legendary aquatic gear."
	]
	quest.6D74185981D07294.quest_subtitle: "&7Leviathan of the deep waters"
	quest.6D74185981D07294.title: "&3Terror of the Oceans: Sea Serpent"
	quest.6D8CA5857B7893C2.quest_desc: [
		"&fDrifting alongside the islands are massive formations of &fAerclouds&f. These condensation blocks exhibit miraculous physical traits:"
		""
		"&b• Cold Aercloud:&f Fluffy white clouds that completely negate fall damage when landed upon, though walking through them slows movement."
		"&9• Blue Aercloud:&f Vibrant indigo clouds that act as natural super-trampolines, propelling entities hundreds of blocks into the sky!"
		"&6• Golden Aercloud:&f Denser, buoyant clouds that prevent falls and serve as compact platforming terrain."
	]
	quest.6D8CA5857B7893C2.quest_subtitle: "&7The Stratospheric Formations"
	quest.6D8CA5857B7893C2.title: "&fWalking on Air"
	quest.6DADD6C795A76D79.quest_desc: [
		"&fA coiled spring-ring enchanted with nimble enchantments."
		""
		"&fEnhances your &bCombat Roll&f agility, reducing stamina costs and roll recharge times."
		""
		"&fVital for sliding out of creeper blasts, dodging sweeping boss attacks, and repositioning instantly behind heavily shielded foes."
	]
	quest.6DADD6C795A76D79.quest_subtitle: "&bGraceful Tumbling"
	quest.6DADD6C795A76D79.title: "&fLesser Combat Roll"
	quest.6DBC1F8FBAC55654.quest_desc: [
		"&fVessels of wandering nether spirits:"
		""
		"• &3Soulkeeper:&f Glaive that stores soul charges to deploy defensive phantoms."
		"• &3Soulpyre:&f Burning soul-spear setting the ground ablaze with blue soulfire."
		""
		"&fCollect both spiritual arms to master the nether realm's lost spirits."
	]
	quest.6DBC1F8FBAC55654.quest_subtitle: "&7Twin guardians of wandering nether phantoms"
	quest.6DBC1F8FBAC55654.title: "&3Soul Wardens"
	quest.6DF401211DE6B87B.quest_desc: [
		"&fAwakening the Lichblade to &bLevel 4&f at the Runic Forge transforms it into the &dWaking Lichblade&f. A chilling ethereal aura surrounds the steel, unlocking its primary active abilities."
	]
	quest.6DF401211DE6B87B.quest_subtitle: "&7The blade stirs at Awakening Level 4"
	quest.6DF401211DE6B87B.title: "&dWaking Lichblade"
	quest.6DF490E7A23E3EC0.quest_desc: [
		"&fDiscovered nestled inside deep voidstone caverns, &eStarcore&f (formerly known as Atalphaite) radiates warm luminescent stellar energy."
		""
		"&fStarcore blocks and lights emit clean, high-intensity illumination without burning down nearby foliage. Beyond lighting, refined Starcore is prized for energizing celestial devices and magical catalysts."
	]
	quest.6DF490E7A23E3EC0.quest_subtitle: "&7Glistening fragments of fallen nebulae"
	quest.6DF490E7A23E3EC0.title: "&bCelestial Radiance: Starcore"
	quest.6E103F8C95A830CA.quest_desc: [
		"&fCatch &dUrshifu&f to add this rare Pokémon to your legendary field record."
		"&7The capture task completes automatically."
	]
	quest.6E103F8C95A830CA.quest_subtitle: "&7Catch Urshifu"
	quest.6E103F8C95A830CA.title: "&dUrshifu"
	quest.6E21F203B9F3351F.quest_desc: [
		"&fObtain the &6Omni Ring&f after completing the required mechanical path for Mega Evolution, Z-Moves, Dynamax/Gigantamax and Terastallization."
		""
		"&fThis is the chapter capstone. The four systems remain visually separate, but all of them feed into this final optional mastery objective."
	]
	quest.6E21F203B9F3351F.quest_subtitle: "&7A final trophy for mastering all four battle phenomena"
	quest.6E21F203B9F3351F.title: "&6★ Omni Ring"
	quest.6E3249140D1A4AFA.quest_desc: [
		"&fCatch &dFezandipiti&f to add this rare Pokémon to your legendary field record."
		"&7The capture task completes automatically."
	]
	quest.6E3249140D1A4AFA.quest_subtitle: "&7Catch Fezandipiti"
	quest.6E3249140D1A4AFA.title: "&dFezandipiti"
	quest.6E473CCF2A6D1FA8.quest_desc: [
		"&fPerched atop rugged hills and plateaus, &eHippogryphs&f scour the plains for prey. While aggressive if approached carelessly, they can be tamed through a unique ritual."
		""
		"&bTaming Method:&f Drop several &eRabbit Feet&f onto the ground near a wild Hippogryph. As it consumes them, hearts will signal its loyalty. Once tamed, equip it with a saddle and custom &eHippogryph Armor&f."
		""
		"&fWild or slain specimens drop razor-sharp &eHippogryph Talons&f, an ideal ingredient for forging a high-reach &eHippogryph Sword&f."
	]
	quest.6E473CCF2A6D1FA8.quest_subtitle: "&7Half eagle, half horse, fully sovereign"
	quest.6E473CCF2A6D1FA8.title: "&6Pride of the Skies: Hippogryph"
	quest.6E50BD6B131EC425.quest_desc: [
		"&fRising majestically upon the central plateau stands the &dFinal Castle&f—the architectural zenith of the entire dimension."
		""
		"&eThe Truth Behind the Castle:&f"
		"&fThroughout the history of The Twilight Forest, the final castle has stood as an awe-inspiring, mysterious fortress. However, &cits final boss has never been fully implemented by the mod developers&f! It remains officially a &6Work In Progress (WIP)&f."
		""
		"&fInside, you will find runic force fields blocking the inner sanctuary, and at the summit waits the famous &bplaceholder Kobold and the iconic sign: 'You Win!'&f"
		""
		"&aBy conquering the Thornlands and breaching the Castle gates, you have conquered every boss, dungeon, and trial the Twilight Forest offers!&f"
		""
		"&6Congratulations on mastering the Twilight Forest!&f"
	]
	quest.6E50BD6B131EC425.quest_subtitle: "&7At the summit of the unfinished realm"
	quest.6E50BD6B131EC425.title: "&d★ The Final Castle: Sovereign of Twilight"
	quest.6E5B2E2F1C17AC4D.quest_desc: [
		"&fThe Aether is inhabited by peaceful, airborne fauna. You will encounter winged &fFlying Cows&f, winged &dPhygs&f (pigs that can be saddled and ridden across chasms), and woolly &fSheepuffs&f that puff up like balloons."
		""
		"&aThe most endearing creature is the &eAerbunny&f. &bRight-click&f an Aerbunny to lift it onto your head! While carrying an Aerbunny, you experience permanent gentle gliding and zero fall damage."
	]
	quest.6E5B2E2F1C17AC4D.quest_subtitle: "&7Gentle Denizens of the Clouds"
	quest.6E5B2E2F1C17AC4D.title: "&fBunnies and Sky Beasts"
	quest.6ED374465B47B8F9.quest_desc: [
		"&fDeep within dense jungles, feathered serpentine &aAmphitheres&f dart through the canopy at breathtaking velocity."
		""
		"&bTaming Rodeo:&f Unlike other mounts, taming an Amphithere requires jumping directly onto its back! It will violently thrash, dive, and slam you into trees and cliffs. Survive the violent ride until hearts appear."
		""
		"&fSlain amphitheres drop iridescent &eAmphithere Feathers&f, used to craft extraordinarily aerodynamic &eAmphithere Arrows&f and the brutal sweeping &eAmphithere Macuahuitl&f."
	]
	quest.6ED374465B47B8F9.quest_subtitle: "&7Rodeo among the jungle treetops"
	quest.6ED374465B47B8F9.title: "&aCanopy Gliders: Amphithere"
	quest.6F4C67BC00F35604.quest_desc: [
		"&fYour dragon can be commanded using the &eDragon Command Staff&f to cycle between &bStay&f (sitting in place), &bWander&f (patrolling around home), and &bEscort&f (following you from above)."
		""
		"&bThe Dragon Flute:&f When your dragon is circling high in the sky or engaging distant hostile mobs, blow the &eDragon Flute&f to immediately compel it to land right beside you."
		""
		"&fOnce your dragon reaches &bStage 3&f, you can mount its back and ride it directly into the sky without requiring a saddle!"
	]
	quest.6F4C67BC00F35604.quest_subtitle: "&7Calling your dragon from the clouds"
	quest.6F4C67BC00F35604.title: "&eCommands of the Sky: The Flute"
	quest.6F5868B52E849731.quest_desc: [
		"&fA fluid runic polearm that controls the perimeter. Sweeping attacks trigger both the bleed implicit and runic spell bursts."
	]
	quest.6F5868B52E849731.quest_subtitle: "&7Sweeping runic blade dominating crowd encounters"
	quest.6F5868B52E849731.title: "&dRunic Glaive"
	quest.6F9703FACE4649BD.quest_desc: [
		"&fRegister &e100 Water-type Pokémon&r&f in your Pokédex."
		""
		"&7Dual-type Pokémon count when Water is one of their types."
	]
	quest.6F9703FACE4649BD.quest_subtitle: "&7Register 100 Water-type Pokémon"
	quest.6F9703FACE4649BD.title: "&6Water Mastery&r"
	quest.6FAA334538037984.quest_desc: [
		"&fDragons naturally age one day every 20 minutes in real time. However, hungry dragons will gladly consume &eDragon Meal&f (crafted from meat and bones) to instantly gain age and stage progress!"
		""
		"&bControlling Size:&f Not all dragon tamers desire a massive house-destroying Stage 5 behemoth. Feeding your dragon &eSickly Dragon Meal&f permanently freezes its growth at its current stage, allowing you to keep a permanent shoulder pet or compact mount."
		""
		"&fTo resume growth later, simply feed it normal Dragon Meal again."
	]
	quest.6FAA334538037984.quest_subtitle: "&7Nurturing a hatchling into a sky sovereign"
	quest.6FAA334538037984.title: "&aNutrition and Growth Control"
	quest.6FD6079C84025112.quest_desc: [
		"&fCraft a &eMason's Table&f from Chipped to unlock a large library of stone, brick and masonry patterns."
		"&7Place ordinary building blocks into the table to browse compatible decorative variants."
	]
	quest.6FD6079C84025112.quest_subtitle: "&7Shape stone, brick and masonry variants"
	quest.6FD6079C84025112.title: "&eMasonry Masterclass&r"
	quest.6FFBF5CCAA934E36.quest_desc: [
		"&fThe &3Sculk Snapper&f is a predatory quadrupede that stalks the Deeplands. In the wild, they drop &eSculk Bones&f when felled."
		""
		"&fHowever, they possess an irresistible craving for &eGleam Gel&f. Each gel fed to a wild Snapper has a 20% chance to tame it!"
		""
		"&aA Loyal Beast:&f Once tamed, the Snapper gains increased maximum health, will fiercely protect you in combat, and can be commanded to sit by right-clicking."
	]
	quest.6FFBF5CCAA934E36.quest_subtitle: "&7Taming an apex sculk companion"
	quest.6FFBF5CCAA934E36.title: "&aThe Hound of the Deeplands"
	quest.705F1AAF9E37A6AC.quest_desc: [
		"&fCatch &dTing-Lu&f to add this rare Pokémon to your legendary field record."
		"&7The capture task completes automatically."
	]
	quest.705F1AAF9E37A6AC.quest_subtitle: "&7Catch Ting-Lu"
	quest.705F1AAF9E37A6AC.title: "&dTing-Lu"
	quest.70A195D4F71CF95D.quest_desc: [
		"&fBattle a trainer from &eRadical Cobblemon Trainers&f and win. Heal first and bring answers for more than one Pokémon type."
		"&fThe &eTrainer Card&f provides a way into the mod's trainer progression. Use EMI to find its recipe and inspect the trainer interface as you explore."
		"&aThis pack allows leveling beyond trainer-series caps.&f You do not need to defeat a gym simply to keep gaining Pokémon experience."
	]
	quest.70A195D4F71CF95D.quest_subtitle: "&7Your first Radical Cobblemon Trainers victory."
	quest.70A195D4F71CF95D.title: "&6Challenge a Trainer"
	quest.70C6BE6030F55B6F.quest_desc: [
		"&fGold weapons in &eSimply Swords&f retain their high innate enchantability and featherlight handling, but suffer from notoriously fragile durability."
		""
		"&fWhile you likely will not carry a &eGold Longsword&f into long expeditions, forging one proves your metallurgy and paves the way toward resilient crystalline arms."
	]
	quest.70C6BE6030F55B6F.quest_subtitle: "&7Lustrous, enchantable, yet fleeting"
	quest.70C6BE6030F55B6F.title: "&fGilded Edge"
	quest.70E8E45E68750488.quest_desc: [
		"&fDynamax a Pokémon in battle."
		""
		"&fThis quest verifies the actual transformation rather than stopping at item collection."
	]
	quest.70E8E45E68750488.quest_subtitle: "&7Perform a real Dynamax transformation in battle"
	quest.70E8E45E68750488.title: "&5★ Dynamax"
	quest.70E9897AA5D89DDF.quest_desc: [
		"&fCatch &dIron Crown&f to add this rare Pokémon to your legendary field record."
		"&7The capture task completes automatically."
	]
	quest.70E9897AA5D89DDF.quest_subtitle: "&7Catch Iron Crown"
	quest.70E9897AA5D89DDF.title: "&dIron Crown"
	quest.715A543F5A8D6404.quest_desc: [
		"&fInside the active Dragon Forge, place &eIron Ingots&f alongside bottles of matching &eDragon Blood&f."
		""
		"&fAs your dragon breathes continuous elemental fire/frost/lightning into the aperture, the forge slowly charges. Once temperature peaks, it fuses the materials into genuine &6Dragonsteel Ingots&f!"
		""
		"&fDragonsteel is the single most durable and powerful crafting material in the entire mod, rendering all previous tiers obsolete."
	]
	quest.715A543F5A8D6404.quest_subtitle: "&7Born from iron and draconic flame"
	quest.715A543F5A8D6404.title: "&6Dragonsteel: The Supreme Alloy"
	quest.71609210F4EDC82E.quest_desc: [
		"&fAttach a &bStorage Terminal&f directly to your &eInventory Connector&f, an &7Inventory Cable&f, or any touching trim."
		""
		"&fOpening this terminal displays every single item stored across all connected chests, barrels, and drawers in one clean interface:"
		"&f• Instant search filtering by name, mod namespace (@mod), or tooltip."
		"&f• Multiple sorting modes (by quantity, alphabetical, ID, or recent additions)."
		"&f• Shift-click to withdraw or deposit stacks in a fraction of a second."
		""
		"&aYou will never manually browse individual chests again.&f"
	]
	quest.71609210F4EDC82E.quest_subtitle: "&7One search bar for thousands of items"
	quest.71609210F4EDC82E.title: "&bThe Master Index"
	quest.7178F61F961A7648.quest_desc: [
		"&fBackpacks are not limited to solid items. With specialized upgrades, they store fluids and electrical energy:"
		""
		"&f• &3Tank Upgrade&f: Adds internal fluid storage tanks. Holds lava for furnace fuel, water for farming/cooling, or modded fluids."
		"&f• &eBattery Upgrade&f: Houses Forge Energy (FE) to charge powered tools, jetpacks, and devices resting in your inventory."
		""
		"&aUse bucket interactions or fluid pumps to fill and empty the internal tank with ease.&f"
	]
	quest.7178F61F961A7648.quest_subtitle: "&7Fluids and charge inside your pack"
	quest.7178F61F961A7648.title: "&3Portable Reservoirs"
	quest.717D5537D7253331.quest_desc: [
		"&fThis expedition covers &eKanto, Johto, Hoenn&f in generation order."
		"&fCapture quests share one visual format; related evolutionary families unlock together."
		"&7Dependency lines are hidden to keep the regional grids readable."
	]
	quest.717D5537D7253331.quest_subtitle: "&7A regional legendary and mythical field guide"
	quest.717D5537D7253331.title: "&6Legendary Expeditions: Kanto–Hoenn"
	quest.718239C89F99B9D7.quest_desc: [
		"&fA pristine azure statuette cold as the heart of a blizzard."
		""
		"&fHarmonizes with frost magic, defensive warding, and magical mana conservation."
		""
		"&fProtects its bearer while locking enemies in perpetual permafrost."
	]
	quest.718239C89F99B9D7.quest_subtitle: "&bThe Glacial Idol of Serenity"
	quest.718239C89F99B9D7.title: "&9Sapphire Jewel Figurine"
	quest.7186B9A47F3D7C20.quest_desc: [
		"&fDefeat a &etier-one raid&f. Bring a healthy team and choose moves that help against the raid target's typing."
		"&fUse the raid interface to understand the available support actions. After winning, inspect the encounter's rewards and recovery needs before taking on another raid."
	]
	quest.7186B9A47F3D7C20.quest_subtitle: "&7Defeat a tier-one raid."
	quest.7186B9A47F3D7C20.title: "&6Your First Raid Victory"
	quest.71CB159544981999.quest_desc: [
		"&fEntering the scorching volcanic &4Fire Swamp&f, you will locate a hollow obsidian mound housing the &4Hydra&f."
		""
		"&bThe Fight:&f"
		"&f• The Hydra is heavily armored; body shots do almost no damage."
		"&f• &eWatch for when a head opens its jaws&f to hiss, spit explosive firebombs, or spew flame. Strike directly into the open maw for massive critical damage!"
		"&f• Whenever a head is destroyed, two new heads sprout in its place, increasing its attack frequency."
		""
		"&aRewards:&f Vanquishing the Hydra yields &cFiery Blood&f, delicious &eHydra Chops&f, and the Hydra Trophy."
	]
	quest.71CB159544981999.quest_subtitle: "&7Dominion of the Fire Swamp"
	quest.71CB159544981999.title: "&4The Multi-Headed Calamity: Hydra"
	quest.721B628A2C2D854F.quest_desc: [
		"&fRegister &e30 Ice-type Pokémon&r&f in your Pokédex."
		""
		"&7Dual-type Pokémon count when Ice is one of their types."
	]
	quest.721B628A2C2D854F.quest_subtitle: "&7Register 30 Ice-type Pokémon"
	quest.721B628A2C2D854F.title: "&6Ice Mastery&r"
	quest.722D0BEFA389964F.quest_desc: [
		"&fA fully grown dragon spans dozens of blocks wide, making navigation through tight bases, caves, and nether portals nearly impossible."
		""
		"&bThe Dragon Horn:&f Right-click your tamed dragon with an empty Dragon Horn to gently compress and store the creature inside a compact pocket dimensional horn!"
		""
		"&fRight-click the horn on any solid ground block to instantly release your dragon, retaining its exact health, age, armor, and inventory untouched."
	]
	quest.722D0BEFA389964F.quest_subtitle: "&7Carrying an apex predator in your pocket"
	quest.722D0BEFA389964F.title: "&6The Pocket Dragon: Dragon Horn"
	quest.727139B409E0F110.quest_desc: [
		"&fGhosts haunt graveyards and phase through terrain. Silver weapons are especially useful against these restless spirits."
		"&fA player-killed Ghost has a small chance to drop a &eGhost Ingot&f. Hunt them directly; Ectoplasm is not smelted into the ingot in this pack."
	]
	quest.727139B409E0F110.quest_subtitle: "&7When the dead refuse their peace"
	quest.727139B409E0F110.title: "&7Restless Wraiths and Graveyard Soil"
	quest.728B87C11CB577AF.quest_desc: [
		"&fCatch &dZamazenta&f to add this rare Pokémon to your legendary field record."
		"&7The capture task completes automatically."
	]
	quest.728B87C11CB577AF.quest_subtitle: "&7Catch Zamazenta"
	quest.728B87C11CB577AF.title: "&dZamazenta"
	quest.72D7B491D10CD227.quest_desc: [
		"&fYou have a &dfree &forigin change for the first 60 minutes of playtime. Use &b/originchange"
		"&fOrigin orbs are difficult to get so choose carefully."
	]
	quest.72D7B491D10CD227.quest_subtitle: "Choose carefully"
	quest.72D7B491D10CD227.title: "&dChoose your origin"
	quest.72FF5D2A386ECBE0.quest_desc: [
		"&fAn emerald phoenix feather pulsing with urgent warmth."
		""
		"&fPerk mechanic: Falling below critical health threshold immediately triggers a potent emergency &aBurst Heal&f."
		""
		"&fFunctions as a lifesaving auto-potion that prevents sudden burst deaths in chaotic fights."
	]
	quest.72FF5D2A386ECBE0.quest_subtitle: "&cDefying the Brink of Death"
	quest.72FF5D2A386ECBE0.title: "&dGreater Perk: Lifebuoy"
	quest.731EA26134ADB44C.quest_desc: [
		"&fAn apex magical engine glowing with blinding multidimensional aurora light."
		""
		"&fActive ability: Plants a magical leyline nexus that supercharges all friendly spellcasters within with godlike &dSpell Power&f."
		""
		"&fThe crowning achievement of arcane engineering, melting bosses in seconds under synchronized spell volleys."
	]
	quest.731EA26134ADB44C.quest_subtitle: "&dConvergence of Ancient Magic"
	quest.731EA26134ADB44C.title: "&6Superior Leyline Nexus"
	quest.736567D36566FAD6.quest_desc: [
		"&fCrafted by fusing glass with &eSoul Dust&f and &eSoul Crystals&f, &7Soundproof Glass&f possesses unique acoustic insulation properties."
		""
		"&fVibrations, footsteps, and sound waves cannot penetrate through soundproof glass. Use it to construct safe viewing galleries and noise-proof laboratories near Sculk Shriekers and Wardens."
	]
	quest.736567D36566FAD6.quest_subtitle: "&7Glass that swallows sound and vibrations"
	quest.736567D36566FAD6.title: "&7Acoustic Dampening"
	quest.74594BFC7AFFF662.quest_desc: [
		"&fStop running back and forth to pick up drops after strip mining or clearing mob spawners."
		""
		"&f• &ePickup Upgrade&f: Automatically routes items picked up by the player directly into the backpack if matching space exists."
		"&f• &bMagnet Upgrade&f: Actively pulls nearby floating item drops toward you from several blocks away."
		""
		"&aAdvanced variants allow strict tag/item filtering, damage tolerance matching, and custom radius adjustments.&f"
	]
	quest.74594BFC7AFFF662.quest_subtitle: "&7Vacuuming the ground clean"
	quest.74594BFC7AFFF662.title: "&bMagnetic Attraction"
	quest.74DC2FF2C0533023.quest_desc: [
		"&fObtain &5Dynamax Candy&f."
		""
		"&fDynamax Level improves the strength of the Dynamax HP increase, turning the candy into a real progression system rather than a simple unlock item."
	]
	quest.74DC2FF2C0533023.quest_subtitle: "&7Raise a Pokémon's Dynamax Level"
	quest.74DC2FF2C0533023.title: "&5Dynamax Candy"
	quest.751F2F2CFF0F8EF2.quest_desc: [
		"&fWhile the PokéNav scans broad surroundings, the &bPokéFinder&f acts as a targeted DexNav scanner."
		""
		"&fSelect a target species on your radar to lock telemetry. The PokéFinder screens specimens for high &eIndividual Values (IVs)&f, coveted &dHidden Abilities&f, special egg moves, and distinctive shiny aura signatures."
		""
		"&aUse it to filter through common spawns and locate competitive treasures without initiating combat!&f"
	]
	quest.751F2F2CFF0F8EF2.quest_subtitle: "&7DexNav Scouting and Genetic Screening"
	quest.751F2F2CFF0F8EF2.title: "&bTargeted Acquisition: PokéFinder"
	quest.7529A7734DC5015E.quest_desc: [
		"&fMake a &eStarbuncle Charm&f and a &eDominion Wand&f. A wild Starbuncle can leave a token after taking a gold nugget; use the token in the charm recipe shown in EMI."
		"&fUse the charm on the ground to summon the helper. With the wand, select the Starbuncle and then an inventory to set a destination. Select an inventory and then the Starbuncle to set a source."
		"&7Begin with one input and one output. Keep a clear walking route, and add filters only after the simple transfer works."
	]
	quest.7529A7734DC5015E.quest_subtitle: "&7Move items around a small workshop."
	quest.7529A7734DC5015E.title: "&aA Starbuncle Helper"
	quest.75390709424B49EE.quest_desc: [
		"&fEnchanted circular throwing blade. Rapidly gains attack speed on consecutive hits, unleashing constant runic bursts."
	]
	quest.75390709424B49EE.quest_subtitle: "&7Whirling runic disc accelerating across combat"
	quest.75390709424B49EE.title: "&dRunic Chakram"
	quest.7554521798381FD6.quest_desc: [
		"&fBy slaying a Stage 4 or 5 female dragon, you recover the most coveted relic in the known world: a genuine &6Dragon Egg&f."
		""
		"&fDragon Eggs are completely immune to normal heat and drops, but they cannot hatch on their own. They require an ancient elemental incubation ritual."
		""
		"&aEnsure you are prepared with food and a command staff before beginning the incubation process!&f"
	]
	quest.7554521798381FD6.quest_subtitle: "&7The ultimate prize of the dragon hoard"
	quest.7554521798381FD6.title: "&6Stealing the Mother's Egg"
	quest.7573D293FE474615.quest_desc: [
		"&fCatch &dRegice&f to add this rare Pokémon to your legendary field record."
		"&7The capture task completes automatically."
	]
	quest.7573D293FE474615.quest_subtitle: "&7Catch Regice"
	quest.7573D293FE474615.title: "&dRegice"
	quest.7580143AA2A2CC71.quest_desc: [
		"&fThe mythical warhammer of thunder gods. Calling down real lightning bolts from clear skies, Mjolnir hurls chain-lightning across entire armies on impact."
		""
		"&aDeterministic Creation:&f Offer a &eContained Remnant&f onto a &bBlock of Iron&f to forge this thunderous hammer!"
	]
	quest.7580143AA2A2CC71.quest_subtitle: "&7Legendary warhammer calling down true lightning"
	quest.7580143AA2A2CC71.title: "&eMjolnir"
	quest.759CDE66BACFB3D0.quest_desc: [
		"&fA fractured psychic crystal humming with discordant frequencies."
		""
		"&fPerk mechanic: Offensive spell impacts have a chance to &dStun&f targets in their tracks."
		""
		"&fProvides invaluable crowd control for spellcasters against aggressive charging monsters."
	]
	quest.759CDE66BACFB3D0.quest_subtitle: "&dArcane Paralyzer"
	quest.759CDE66BACFB3D0.title: "&dGreater Perk: Mind Shatter"
	quest.75B7247EEB2618E8.quest_desc: [
		"&fCatch &dMew&f to add this rare Pokémon to your legendary field record."
		"&7The capture task completes automatically."
	]
	quest.75B7247EEB2618E8.quest_subtitle: "&7Catch Mew"
	quest.75B7247EEB2618E8.title: "&dMew"
	quest.760918156F99E5E8.quest_desc: [
		"&fCatch &dMesprit&f to add this rare Pokémon to your legendary field record."
		"&7The capture task completes automatically."
	]
	quest.760918156F99E5E8.quest_subtitle: "&7Catch Mesprit"
	quest.760918156F99E5E8.title: "&dMesprit"
	quest.761D42022C71F228.quest_desc: [
		"&fCarrying 50 levels of experience into dangerous dungeons is asking for a tragic loss. The &aXP Pump Upgrade&f safeguards your hard-earned wisdom."
		""
		"&bFunctionality&f:"
		"&f• Requires an internal &3Tank Upgrade&f to hold liquid experience."
		"&f• Pumps player levels directly into the tank at customizable level thresholds."
		"&f• Automatically mends damaged tools and armor carrying the &eMending&f enchantment using stored liquid XP!"
		""
		"&aSafely bank your levels before boss fights and keep your gear perpetually repaired.&f"
	]
	quest.761D42022C71F228.quest_subtitle: "&7Automated experience storage and mending"
	quest.761D42022C71F228.title: "&aWisdom on Tap"
	quest.764D449E0C711FA6.quest_desc: [
		"&fCatch &dCresselia&f to add this rare Pokémon to your legendary field record."
		"&7The capture task completes automatically."
	]
	quest.764D449E0C711FA6.quest_subtitle: "&7Catch Cresselia"
	quest.764D449E0C711FA6.title: "&dCresselia"
	quest.7656AF7229D4BEEF.quest_desc: [
		"&fA sharp, polished topaz statuette shaped like a diving falcon."
		""
		"&fAttuned to agility, marksmanship, dexterity, and swift movement speed."
		""
		"&fInvaluable for rangers, gunslingers, and mobile duelists who demand flawless accuracy and mobility."
	]
	quest.7656AF7229D4BEEF.quest_subtitle: "&eThe Radiant Idol of the Swift Wind"
	quest.7656AF7229D4BEEF.title: "&6Topaz Jewel Figurine"
	quest.76609945E3C80EE8.quest_desc: [
		"&fA glowing lapis crystal crackling with dormant arcane currents."
		""
		"&fActive ability: Grants a temporary burst of universal &dSpell Power&f across all magic schools."
		""
		"&fActivate right before unleashing your strongest area-of-effect spells to maximize devastating magical destruction."
	]
	quest.76609945E3C80EE8.quest_subtitle: "&bMystical Surge"
	quest.76609945E3C80EE8.title: "&fLesser Relic of Sorcery"
	quest.76AE35FFF64A6B48.quest_desc: [
		"&fA lightweight wind-forged gear that whirs softly when swung."
		""
		"&fProc effect: Striking targets has a chance to proc a surge of &bAttack Speed&f, accelerating your swing animations."
		""
		"&fTurns claymores and axes into rapid weapons and makes dual daggers attack at blistering speeds."
	]
	quest.76AE35FFF64A6B48.quest_subtitle: "&eRelentless Tempo"
	quest.76AE35FFF64A6B48.title: "&bMedium Flurry Relic"
	quest.76EA63E69EC611F5.quest_desc: [
		"&fCatch &dArticuno&f to add this rare Pokémon to your legendary field record."
		"&7The capture task completes automatically."
	]
	quest.76EA63E69EC611F5.quest_subtitle: "&7Catch Articuno"
	quest.76EA63E69EC611F5.title: "&dArticuno"
	quest.76FAB2F14DEE0B48.quest_desc: [
		"&fObtain a &dMega Stone Crystal&f. This represents the material side of Mega progression before that power is tied to a particular Pokémon."
		""
		"&fFrom here, the branch moves into the species-specific stones used during actual Mega Evolution."
	]
	quest.76FAB2F14DEE0B48.quest_subtitle: "&7A Mega Stone Crystal before it becomes species-specific power"
	quest.76FAB2F14DEE0B48.title: "&dRaw Mega Power"
	quest.770320237AA1C2B3.quest_desc: [
		"&fObtain the standard &dMega Bracelet&f. Mega Showdown includes several alternate styles, but the basic bracelet establishes the wearable required for the main progression."
		""
		"&7The accessory variants branch off separately so cosmetic choices do not block the core mechanic."
	]
	quest.770320237AA1C2B3.quest_subtitle: "&7Carry your Keystone in a battle-ready Mega accessory"
	quest.770320237AA1C2B3.title: "&dMega Bracelet"
	quest.770F318F03D29D64.quest_desc: [
		"&fUpgrade to an &eApprentice Spell Book&f to access its higher-tier glyphs. EMI shows the upgrade ingredients for this pack."
		"&fA higher-tier book expands your options, but a longer spell still needs enough mana. Improve one spell you already use before building a complicated new combination."
		"&7The Archmage book is a later goal. This introductory guide ends once you have a working workshop and a useful spell toolkit."
	]
	quest.770F318F03D29D64.quest_subtitle: "&7Upgrade when your spell design needs it."
	quest.770F318F03D29D64.title: "&aA Larger Spellbook"
	quest.772B23AF2D802329.quest_desc: [
		"&fCatch &dWo-Chien&f to add this rare Pokémon to your legendary field record."
		"&7The capture task completes automatically."
	]
	quest.772B23AF2D802329.quest_subtitle: "&7Catch Wo-Chien"
	quest.772B23AF2D802329.title: "&dWo-Chien"
	quest.77C9CD32C9D99348.quest_desc: [
		"&fCatch &dGlastrier&f to add this rare Pokémon to your legendary field record."
		"&7The capture task completes automatically."
	]
	quest.77C9CD32C9D99348.quest_subtitle: "&7Catch Glastrier"
	quest.77C9CD32C9D99348.title: "&dGlastrier"
	quest.77D5A60CD2AB4D60.quest_desc: [
		"&fCatch &dNaganadel&f to add this rare Pokémon to your legendary field record."
		"&7The capture task completes automatically."
	]
	quest.77D5A60CD2AB4D60.quest_subtitle: "&7Catch Naganadel"
	quest.77D5A60CD2AB4D60.title: "&dNaganadel"
	quest.77D75AA2BAD12C9C.quest_desc: [
		"&fThe &7Shattered&f are husks of former wanderers whose bodies have been completely overrun by sculk tendrils."
		""
		"&fThey wander the Deeplands in packs, striking with unnatural physical strength and tracking prey by sound and vibration."
		""
		"&fSlaying them yields &eSoul Dust&f—an ethereal fine powder that binds acoustic and soul-based contraptions."
	]
	quest.77D75AA2BAD12C9C.quest_subtitle: "&7Gather Soul Dust from the Shattered"
	quest.77D75AA2BAD12C9C.title: "&7Shattered Souls"
	quest.77EBCBDD9FA1CD0A.quest_desc: [
		"&fCatch &dBlacephalon&f to add this rare Pokémon to your legendary field record."
		"&7The capture task completes automatically."
	]
	quest.77EBCBDD9FA1CD0A.quest_subtitle: "&7Catch Blacephalon"
	quest.77EBCBDD9FA1CD0A.title: "&dBlacephalon"
	quest.77F1DB6723226760.quest_desc: [
		"&fA standard limited barrel holds a modest amount of bulk items, but slotting &eStack Upgrades&f transforms them into black holes."
		""
		"&fEach stack tier multiplies slot capacity exponentially:"
		"&f• &eTier 1&f: 2x (Chests) / 4x (Limited Barrels)"
		"&f• &fTier 2&f: 4x / 8x capacity"
		"&f• &6Tier 3&f: 8x / 16x capacity"
		"&f• &bTier 4 and 5&f: 16x to 32x multipliers"
		""
		"&aCombining a high-tier barrel with stack upgrades lets a single block face store over 30,000 cobblestone!&f"
	]
	quest.77F1DB6723226760.quest_subtitle: "&7Turning thousands of items into a single slot"
	quest.77F1DB6723226760.title: "&bMultiplying the Stacks"
	quest.77FAAB8C21C0F560.quest_desc: [
		"&fSubterranean Greek temples made of overgrown marble house the most terrifying mythological entity in the world: the &5Gorgon&f."
		""
		"&cInstant Death Warning:&f If a Gorgon locks eyes with you for even a fraction of a second, you are instantly turned into a permanent &eStone Statue&f! Armor, health potions, and totems will NOT save you."
		""
		"&bThe Blindfold:&f You MUST wear a &eBlindfold&f before entering her sanctum. You will be completely blind, relying only on directional audio and close-range sweeping swings."
		""
		"&fSevering her head grants the dreaded &dGorgon Head&f, a single-use weapon capable of petrifying even dragons into lifeless stone."
	]
	quest.77FAAB8C21C0F560.quest_subtitle: "&7One glance is all it takes"
	quest.77FAAB8C21C0F560.title: "&5Stone Stare: The Gorgon"
	quest.782E268BAB152CF9.quest_desc: [
		"&fDespite its terrifying atmosphere, The Otherside is remarkably rich in mineral deposits."
		""
		"&fVeins of iron, gold, copper, lapis, redstone, emeralds, and diamonds generate in abundance throughout both &eSculk Stone&f and deep &eGloomslate&f strata."
		""
		"&aTip:&f Keep a Fortune pickaxe handy—mineral generation rates here rival or surpass the Overworld deepslate layer."
	]
	quest.782E268BAB152CF9.quest_subtitle: "&7Precious minerals bound in sculk stone"
	quest.782E268BAB152CF9.title: "&aVeins of the Abyss"
	quest.78486193FD220BE8.quest_desc: [
		"&fThis expedition covers &eAlola, Galar, Hisui and Paldea&f in generation order."
		"&fConfirm this guide to unlock the capture records; related evolutionary families remain linked in sequence."
		"&7Dependency lines are hidden so the regional grid stays readable."
	]
	quest.78486193FD220BE8.quest_subtitle: "&7Alola, Galar, Hisui and Paldea field records"
	quest.78486193FD220BE8.title: "&cLegendary Expeditions: Alola-Paldea"
	quest.785C85DCFB4D9BB2.quest_desc: [
		"&fA tempestuous cutlass that whips gale-force winds around the wielder. Rapid hits build electrical overdrive."
	]
	quest.785C85DCFB4D9BB2.quest_subtitle: "&7Tempestuous cutlass riding the winds of storm"
	quest.785C85DCFB4D9BB2.title: "&eStormbringer"
	quest.788741F04C5B7DCB.quest_desc: [
		"&fUse an &eEye of Abyss&f to find a &eSunken City&f. Prepare underwater breathing and movement before exploring it."
		"&fObtain an &eAbyssal Sacrifice&f and bring it to the &eAltar of Abyss&f when ready. Keep a safe air and return route outside the encounter."
		"&aDefeat the boss to complete this milestone.&f"
	]
	quest.788741F04C5B7DCB.quest_subtitle: "&7Sunken City"
	quest.788741F04C5B7DCB.title: "&bThe Leviathan"
	quest.789267C7AEAC3508.quest_desc: [
		"&fRegister &e30 Steel-type Pokémon&r&f in your Pokédex."
		""
		"&7Dual-type Pokémon count when Steel is one of their types."
	]
	quest.789267C7AEAC3508.quest_subtitle: "&7Register 30 Steel-type Pokémon"
	quest.789267C7AEAC3508.title: "&6Steel Mastery&r"
	quest.78EE23B6191D77A3.quest_desc: [
		"&fThe &2Echoing Forest&f is an alien woodland growing upon nutrient-dense Echo Soil."
		""
		"&fHarvesting the trees provides &eEcho Logs&f, yielding a distinctive cyan-toned lumber ideal for doors, boats, and building blocks."
		""
		"&aTip:&f &eEcho Saplings&f can be brought back to the Overworld and cultivated anywhere for a renewable wood and leaf supply."
		""
		"&aPokémon to watch for:&f Shroomish has an Echoing Forest spawn entry on suitable Otherside ground."
	]
	quest.78EE23B6191D77A3.quest_subtitle: "&7Bring home the forest's strange wood"
	quest.78EE23B6191D77A3.title: "&3Echoing Forest"
	quest.793D6281D6605669.quest_desc: [
		"&fHigh upon windswept mountain ridges and glacial ice-caves in the &ePermafrost Forest&f lies &bGlacite&f."
		""
		"&fChipping away at raw glacite clusters awards &eGlacite Shards&f. Glacite armor and shields offer full immunity against freezing and frostbite, while Glacite Arrows encase targets in immobilizing blocks of ice on impact."
		""
		"&bGlacite is also an indispensable refrigerant coolant for the Alloy Furnace!"
	]
	quest.793D6281D6605669.quest_subtitle: "&7Frozen crystals of the high peaks"
	quest.793D6281D6605669.title: "&bSubzero Glacite"
	quest.7975811B5CC73E69.quest_desc: [
		"&fCraft a &eTerracotta Botany Pot&f; its colored terracotta variants also count. Place it, add soil accepted by your crop, then insert the crop's planting item."
		"&fUse EMI to inspect the crop recipe, soil and growth time. Harvest a regular pot by interacting with its finished crop."
		"&7This is a small alternative to a field, not a requirement to replace your existing farm."
	]
	quest.7975811B5CC73E69.quest_subtitle: "&7A compact farm needs both soil and a crop."
	quest.7975811B5CC73E69.title: "&eYour First Botany Pot"
	quest.79A5EE72DC48C079.quest_desc: [
		"&fA graceful single-edged blade mounted on an elongated haft. The &eGlaive&f blends rapid polearm sweeps with excellent zone-control."
		""
		"&fInflicts &bLaceration&f, stacking bleeding damage quickly thanks to its higher swing rate compared to halberds."
	]
	quest.79A5EE72DC48C079.quest_subtitle: "&7Fluid polearm built for swift sweeping lacerations"
	quest.79A5EE72DC48C079.title: "&fDiamond Glaive"
	quest.79F48133C937F5A3.quest_desc: [
		"&fCollect an &eEnchanting Apparatus&f and an &eArcane Core&f. Use the notebook's diagram to position the core at the apparatus base and arrange Arcane Pedestals within three blocks."
		"&fPut the surrounding recipe ingredients on the pedestals, then use the central ingredient on the apparatus. Provide nearby stored Source when the recipe requires it."
		"&aChoose one accessory or creature charm you actually want.&f The apparatus opens useful options without making every recipe mandatory."
	]
	quest.79F48133C937F5A3.quest_subtitle: "&7Crafting with a core, pedestals and Source."
	quest.79F48133C937F5A3.title: "&aThe Enchanting Apparatus"
	quest.79FA27F5D05A4972.quest_desc: [
		"&fRadiant long-distance martial implements:"
		""
		"• &eDawnquiver:&f Claymore projecting bows of concentrated sunlight, loosing arrows of light without consuming quiver ammo."
		"• &eWickpiercer:&f Throwable spear possessing innate Loyalty and a death-defying wax revival."
	]
	quest.79FA27F5D05A4972.quest_subtitle: "&7Sunlight bows and loyal death-defying spears"
	quest.79FA27F5D05A4972.title: "&eSolar Artillery"
	quest.7A1DA0DAC25269AB.quest_desc: [
		"&fLook for the Gauntlet's structure in the Nether. Its distinctive summoning block triggers the encounter when broken, so prepare before disturbing it."
		"&fCarry fire protection and leave space to dodge. The boss's attacks make standing in a narrow escape tunnel a poor plan."
		"&aDefeat the boss; its advancement completes this quest.&f"
	]
	quest.7A1DA0DAC25269AB.quest_subtitle: "&7A boss milestone, not an inventory checklist."
	quest.7A1DA0DAC25269AB.title: "&bThe Nether Gauntlet"
	quest.7A338894CCAEDA2C.quest_desc: [
		"&fCatch &dKeldeo&f to add this rare Pokémon to your legendary field record."
		"&7The capture task completes automatically."
	]
	quest.7A338894CCAEDA2C.quest_subtitle: "&7Catch Keldeo"
	quest.7A338894CCAEDA2C.title: "&dKeldeo"
	quest.7A77E00C372D7ABA.quest_desc: [
		"&fDescend into the cavernous tunnels beneath the Highlands to locate the &6Troll Caves&f. Cave Trolls guard subterranean treasures and Trollsteinn blocks."
		""
		"&fSearch for an obsidian chamber containing an obsidian chest. Inside, you will discover the legendary &aMagic Beans&f!"
		""
		"&7Also take note of the massive indestructible Giant Obsidian vault nearby—you will return here soon."
	]
	quest.7A77E00C372D7ABA.quest_subtitle: "&7Unearthing ancient seeds beneath the Highlands"
	quest.7A77E00C372D7ABA.title: "&6Troll Caves and The Magic Beans"
	quest.7A863144C8CDCD8E.quest_desc: [
		"&fAn &eEye of Storm&f helps locate the &eAcropolis&f. Prepare for elevated terrain and the journey back before entering its encounter."
		"&fExplore the structure carefully and face &eScylla&f when equipped for a major boss fight. Protect yourself against falls and keep recovery supplies ready."
		"&aDefeat the boss to complete this milestone.&f"
	]
	quest.7A863144C8CDCD8E.quest_subtitle: "&7Acropolis"
	quest.7A863144C8CDCD8E.title: "&bScylla"
	quest.7A910220E2D6EAC1.quest_desc: [
		"&fOvercoming the sentinels of ocean monuments unlocks the pinnacle of oceanic dining."
		""
		"&eBowl of Guardian Soup&f is a monumental meal restoring a massive &b15 hunger points&f and supplying &b3 full minutes of Comfort&f."
		""
		"&fWith three continuous minutes of unconditional regeneration, this chowder stands as one of the finest expedition meals for grueling dungeon delves and underwater excavations."
	]
	quest.7A910220E2D6EAC1.quest_subtitle: "&7Harnessing the power of the monument"
	quest.7A910220E2D6EAC1.title: "&3Guardian Feast: The Apex Chowder"
	quest.7AB83CC58FDE7220.quest_desc: [
		"&fUpgraded from &8Netherite Armor&f using Reinforced Echo Shards and the Warden Upgrade Template, this is the pinnacle armor set."
		""
		"&fWith &a24 Armor Points&f, &a+4 Armor Toughness per piece&f, and massive Knockback Resistance, its intrinsic abilities are game-changing:"
		""
		"&b• Warden Helmet:&f Grants permanent immunity to Darkness and Blindness!"
		"&b• Warden Leggings:&f Grants a constant permanent movement speed boost!"
		"&b• Warden Boots:&f Completely dampens movement vibrations—Sculk Sensors and Wardens cannot hear you walk or sprint!"
	]
	quest.7AB83CC58FDE7220.quest_subtitle: "&7Surpassing Netherite with absolute supremacy"
	quest.7AB83CC58FDE7220.title: "&1The Armor of the Deep Monarch"
	quest.7ADBB4C75C020F62.quest_desc: [
		"&fObtain &eany one za expansion mega stone&r&f from this category."
		""
		"&7One example completes the lesson. The remaining variants are optional collectibles."
	]
	quest.7ADBB4C75C020F62.quest_subtitle: "&7Obtain any one za expansion mega stone"
	quest.7ADBB4C75C020F62.title: "&dZA Mega Expansion"
	quest.7AEF0F135B3097FE.quest_desc: [
		"&fPart rooster, part reptilian horror, the &eCockatrice&f stalks savannas and deserts. Its chilling stare inflicts intense withering decay and nausea upon anyone meeting its gaze."
		""
		"&cBreeding Anomaly:&f Ordinary chickens occasionally lay a foul, discolored &eRotten Egg&f. Throwing these rare eggs has a chance to hatch a domestic Cockatrice that defends its master with that very same withering gaze!"
		""
		"&fSlay wild cockatrices to harvest their petrifying &eCockatrice Eye&f, which can be mounted onto a &eCockatrice Scepter&f to turn the weapon's dreadful beam against your foes."
	]
	quest.7AEF0F135B3097FE.quest_subtitle: "&7Born from foul eggs and dark malice"
	quest.7AEF0F135B3097FE.title: "&eThe Withering Stare: Cockatrice"
	quest.7B169ECA503BB4DF.quest_desc: [
		"&fCatch &dTapu Bulu&f to add this rare Pokémon to your legendary field record."
		"&7The capture task completes automatically."
	]
	quest.7B169ECA503BB4DF.quest_subtitle: "&7Catch Tapu Bulu"
	quest.7B169ECA503BB4DF.title: "&dTapu Bulu"
	quest.7B2DF4D19E2B5AE4.quest_desc: [
		"&eRight-clicking&f the Box Link opens your PC storage boxes anywhere in the world!"
	]
	quest.7B2DF4D19E2B5AE4.quest_subtitle: "Portable PC"
	quest.7B2DF4D19E2B5AE4.title: "&dPocket Storage: Box Link"
	quest.7B3E4E8EAD07C026.quest_desc: [
		"&fAssemble the Fire Dragon Forge from its dormant core, input, bricks and Dragon Bone Blocks."
		"&fThe core activates when it is placed inside a valid multiblock. A tamed Stage 3+ Fire Dragon supplies the breath needed to forge Fire Dragonsteel."
	]
	quest.7B3E4E8EAD07C026.quest_subtitle: "&7A 3x3x3 multiblock powered by live dragon breath"
	quest.7B3E4E8EAD07C026.title: "&6The Ancient Art: The Dragon Forge"
	quest.7B6B1AEF318C51B5.quest_desc: [
		"&fA proper dinner is far superior to munching on loose bread or raw jerky. Simmering balanced dishes produces meals imbued with the &eNourishment&f effect."
		""
		"&fA hearty bowl of &eSteak and Potatoes&f restores &b12 hunger points&f and provides &bNourishment for 3 minutes&f. While Nourished, your hunger bar is completely locked from draining through sprinting, jumping, and mining."
		""
		"&cImportant Note:&f Nourishment does not provide infinite health regeneration. Natural healing will still consume your saturation reserves normally."
	]
	quest.7B6B1AEF318C51B5.quest_subtitle: "&7Hearty meals that keep you going"
	quest.7B6B1AEF318C51B5.title: "&eSustained Stamina: Nourishment"
	quest.7BD6C3327976FC6D.quest_desc: [
		"&fCatch &dGouging Fire&f to add this rare Pokémon to your legendary field record."
		"&7The capture task completes automatically."
	]
	quest.7BD6C3327976FC6D.quest_subtitle: "&7Catch Gouging Fire"
	quest.7BD6C3327976FC6D.title: "&dGouging Fire"
	quest.7BD8E2DF0925B7CA.quest_desc: [
		"&6Interior Design&r is about more than just a bed and a chest. "
		""
		"&fMacaw's Furnitures provides &eBookshelves&r that actually display books, &6Desks&r, and &bWardrobes&r. Combine these with &6Lighting&r options like &eChandeliers&r and &cTiki Torches&r for a perfect atmosphere."
	]
	quest.7BD8E2DF0925B7CA.quest_subtitle: "&7Furnish and light an interior"
	quest.7BD8E2DF0925B7CA.title: "&eAtmospheric Interiors&r"
	quest.7C10747650D77F8A.quest_desc: [
		"&fGigantamax a compatible Pokémon in battle."
		""
		"&fThis is the final required Dynamax milestone and demonstrates the difference between ordinary Dynamax and a species-specific G-Max form."
	]
	quest.7C10747650D77F8A.quest_subtitle: "&7Prove the specialized G-Max transformation in battle"
	quest.7C10747650D77F8A.title: "&5★ Gigantamax"
	quest.7C46FCCC2348D0E3.quest_desc: [
		"&fCatch &dChien-Pao&f to add this rare Pokémon to your legendary field record."
		"&7The capture task completes automatically."
	]
	quest.7C46FCCC2348D0E3.quest_subtitle: "&7Catch Chien-Pao"
	quest.7C46FCCC2348D0E3.title: "&dChien-Pao"
	quest.7C741B1FDDAD0137.quest_desc: [
		"&fObtain &eany one mega meteorite block&r&f from this category."
		""
		"&7One example completes the lesson. The remaining variants are optional collectibles."
	]
	quest.7C741B1FDDAD0137.quest_subtitle: "&7Obtain any one mega meteorite block"
	quest.7C741B1FDDAD0137.title: "&dMeteoroid Masonry"
	quest.7D0B9EFC6B7A130F.quest_desc: [
		"&fDirectly beneath the lush Aether Dirt lies &7Holystone&f, the pale rock that constitutes the bulk of every floating island."
		""
		"&fWhen harvested with a pickaxe, it drops standard Holystone. Crafting &bHolystone Tools&f grants a passive chance to randomly uncover &eAmbrosium Shards&f while mining stone or engaging in combat."
		""
		"&aUse Holystone to construct sturdy masonry, furnaces, and basic defensive perimeters."
	]
	quest.7D0B9EFC6B7A130F.quest_subtitle: "&7The Resilient Crust of the Skylands"
	quest.7D0B9EFC6B7A130F.title: "&7Solid Foundations"
	quest.7D0C9224185199DA.quest_desc: [
		"&bWaypoints&f, &aWaystones&f, and &bUltimine&f are helpful tools that will save you time."
	]
	quest.7D0C9224185199DA.title: "&eExploration and Quality of Life"
	quest.7D229D2A2365E3C0.quest_desc: [
		"&fVeins of &eSilver Ore&f cut through stone and deepslate alike. While softer than iron for conventional tools, silver possesses extraordinary sacred resonance."
		""
		"&bUndead and unnatural monsters&f—including graveyard ghosts, skeletons, zombies, and dreaded dread beasts—suffer massive bonus damage when struck by &eSilver Weapons&f."
		""
		"&fEquipping a full suit of &eSilver Metal Armor&f additionally grants the wearer powerful defensive purity, cleansing harmful status effects faster."
		""
		"&aBefore hunting the darker entities lurking in the woods and caves, smelt yourself a silver blade.&f"
	]
	quest.7D229D2A2365E3C0.quest_subtitle: "&7Purifying the unnatural"
	quest.7D229D2A2365E3C0.title: "&bSacred Metallurgy: Silver"
	quest.7D53223287FDC43F.quest_desc: [
		"&fFill the tank with organic material (any plant). Then place your fossil in the analyzer."
		""
		"&eThe screen will change colors once the machine is done. Interact with any poke ball to claim your new pokemon."
	]
	quest.7D53223287FDC43F.quest_subtitle: "Revive a Fossil"
	quest.7D53223287FDC43F.title: "&d★ Breath of Life: First Fossil Revival"
	quest.7D7632D13DFBDB16.quest_desc: [
		"&fRegister &e50 Rock-type Pokémon&r&f in your Pokédex."
		""
		"&7Dual-type Pokémon count when Rock is one of their types."
	]
	quest.7D7632D13DFBDB16.quest_subtitle: "&7Register 50 Rock-type Pokémon"
	quest.7D7632D13DFBDB16.title: "&6Rock Mastery&r"
	quest.7D927CDAA723C4E9.quest_desc: [
		"&fSwets are giant translucent gelatinous creatures roaming the grass. When disturbed, they leap and attempt to absorb you inside their viscous bodies!"
		""
		"&fSlaying Blue and Golden Swets yields &bSwet Balls&f. Swet balls can be processed into decorative Swet Capes, or devoured as &6Golden Gummy Swets&f—legendary treats that instantaneously restore 10 full hearts of health!"
	]
	quest.7D927CDAA723C4E9.quest_subtitle: "&7Bouncy Predators and Confectionery"
	quest.7D927CDAA723C4E9.title: "&9Gelatinous Swets"
	quest.7E259C18DE7A6829.quest_desc: [
		"&fSimply More extends the weapon selection alongside &eSimply Swords&f. Compare attack speed, reach and the weapon's special behavior before committing your best materials."
		"&fUse the training space around your base to test a weapon's attack rhythm with Better Combat. A slower weapon needs different spacing than a quick one."
		"&7The original Simply Swords chapter remains the guide to its own materials and weapons. These entries cover the addon's choices."
	]
	quest.7E259C18DE7A6829.quest_subtitle: "&7Choose reach and rhythm, not just damage."
	quest.7E259C18DE7A6829.title: "&aBeyond Simply Swords"
	quest.7E298AC1AC821DC7.quest_desc: [
		"&fBy bathing a Dragonbone Sword in bottled &cDragon Blood&f within a crafting grid, you awaken the dormant elemental magic within the marrow."
		""
		"&c• Flamed Dragonbone Sword:&f Sets targets ablaze with scorching dragon flame and knocks enemies backwards."
		"&b• Iced Dragonbone Sword:&f Freezes opponents solid, applying crippling slowness."
		"&e• Shocked Dragonbone Sword:&f Discharges chain lightning shocks into surrounding adversaries."
		""
		"&aElemental blades deal massive bonus damage against dragons of the opposing element!&f"
	]
	quest.7E298AC1AC821DC7.quest_subtitle: "&7Imbuing dragonbone with elemental fury"
	quest.7E298AC1AC821DC7.title: "&cBlood-Forged Edges"
	quest.7E3132D31165B9EC.quest_desc: [
		"&fCatch &dMoltres&f to add this rare Pokémon to your legendary field record."
		"&7The capture task completes automatically."
	]
	quest.7E3132D31165B9EC.quest_subtitle: "&7Catch Moltres"
	quest.7E3132D31165B9EC.title: "&dMoltres"
	quest.7E373FDE11C902FA.quest_desc: [
		"&fSearch the Overworld for the Night Lich's tower. &eSoul Stars&f help guide the search and are used with the tower's summoning altars."
		"&fBring a ranged option and keep sight of the surrounding terrain. Prepare before completing the altar arrangement."
		"&aDefeat the boss; its advancement completes this quest.&f"
	]
	quest.7E373FDE11C902FA.quest_subtitle: "&7A boss milestone, not an inventory checklist."
	quest.7E373FDE11C902FA.title: "&bThe Night Lich"
	quest.7E81CAD2B48E7125.quest_desc: [
		"&fExplore deep underground for the &eVoid Blossom&f cavern. A &eVoid Lily&f is a useful tool to investigate when searching for this boss."
		"&fTake lighting, food and a clear route back to the surface. Fight from a position where you can move away from hazards."
		"&aDefeat the boss; its advancement completes this quest.&f"
	]
	quest.7E81CAD2B48E7125.quest_subtitle: "&7A boss milestone, not an inventory checklist."
	quest.7E81CAD2B48E7125.title: "&bThe Void Blossom"
	quest.7E88FA5FCCF59100.quest_desc: [
		"&fObtain &eany one kanto mega stone&r&f from this category."
		""
		"&7One example completes the lesson. The remaining variants are optional collectibles."
	]
	quest.7E88FA5FCCF59100.quest_subtitle: "&7Obtain any one kanto mega stone"
	quest.7E88FA5FCCF59100.title: "&dKanto Mega Stones"
	quest.7E91D08725B18463.quest_desc: [
		"&fCatch &dZeraora&f to add this rare Pokémon to your legendary field record."
		"&7The capture task completes automatically."
	]
	quest.7E91D08725B18463.quest_subtitle: "&7Catch Zeraora"
	quest.7E91D08725B18463.title: "&dZeraora"
	quest.7EB37B551F782988.quest_desc: [
		"&fThe master of the mausoleum, the &5Dread Lich&f, wields a staff capable of launching explosive shadows and raising undead armies from thin air."
		""
		"&fClaiming the &dDread Lich Staff&f allows you to cast these devastating shadowy bursts against your enemies, decaying their vitality while summoning friendly dread thralls to fight on your behalf."
	]
	quest.7EB37B551F782988.quest_subtitle: "&7Harnessing the dark sorcery of the north"
	quest.7EB37B551F782988.title: "&5Staff of the Dread Lich"
	quest.7F2E4C4AE9B33B1B.quest_desc: [
		"&fThere are 9 distinct Gloomsherd varieties dropped by Overcast Pots: &7Blank, Brittle, Dark Heart, Listener, Snapper, Temple, Transmission, Ward,&f and &7Wayfinder&f."
		""
		"&fArrange these sherds on a crafting grid with Gloomslate to forge decorative &eGloomslate Pots&f, showcasing your archaeological exploits across the abyss."
	]
	quest.7F2E4C4AE9B33B1B.quest_subtitle: "&7Reconstructing decorative Gloomslate Pots"
	quest.7F2E4C4AE9B33B1B.title: "&6Abyssal Archaeology"
	quest.7F40F3523E7DB7C3.quest_desc: [
		"&fRegister &e40 Bug-type Pokémon&r&f in your Pokédex."
		""
		"&7Dual-type Pokémon count when Bug is one of their types."
	]
	quest.7F40F3523E7DB7C3.quest_subtitle: "&7Register 40 Bug-type Pokémon"
	quest.7F40F3523E7DB7C3.title: "&6Bug Mastery&r"
	quest.7F6EBD213CAD0348.quest_desc: [
		"&fThe starlit soil supports rich agricultural wonders. Gather seeds to cultivate &eCrinoa&f (wholesome porridge grains), sharp &ePungency Fruit&f, and starlight-infused &eNocturnal Millet&f."
		""
		"&bThe Oblivion Secret:&f Roasting Forgotten Nocturnal Millet produces &eRoasted Forgotten Nocturnal Millet&f. Consuming it bestows the &dOblivion Effect&f, momentarily granting the extraordinary power to &bwalk directly through solid walls&f!"
		""
		"&aUse the Drying Rack to cure meats and preserve forageable delicacies."
	]
	quest.7F6EBD213CAD0348.quest_subtitle: "&7Native crops and phase-walking cuisine"
	quest.7F6EBD213CAD0348.title: "&aHarvest of the Night Sky"
	quest.7FCF65E05946A7B2.quest_desc: [
		"&fObtain a &eNovice Spell Book&f and a &eScribe's Table&f. Open the book's spell interface using its configured control and combine a casting method with an effect."
		"&fUse the book on the table to choose a new glyph. Supply the ingredients and experience shown by the table, then learn the resulting glyph."
		"&aStart with one useful spell and test it away from your storage.&f Check your mana cost before adding more effects."
	]
	quest.7FCF65E05946A7B2.quest_subtitle: "&7A casting book and a place to learn glyphs."
	quest.7FCF65E05946A7B2.title: "&aBuild Your Spellbook"
