	quest.BE7AAB2C2B9DDE41.quest_desc: [
		"&fCollect one of every HP potion: &ePotion&f (20 HP), &eSuper Potion&f (60), &eHyper Potion&f (120), &eMax Potion&f (full HP) and &eFull Restore&f (full HP and cures status)."
