	quest.EB3C6FC1AFC0FB42.quest_desc: [
		"&fIf the holder is at 100% full HP and takes a lethal hit, they are guaranteed to endure the attack with 1 HP remaining. Consumed upon use. The quintessential item for frail sweepers, revenge killers, and hazard leads."
		""
		"&7Lethal one-hit knockouts can ruin an entire battle plan. Survival bands and sashes ensure your glass cannons or setup sweepers always get their turn:"
		""
		"&7Part of: Enduring Bulwarks: Focus Sash and Band"
	]
