	quest.24168B4FAC57C4FA.title: "&6Caught: 500"
	quest.253CA2B565A22867.quest_desc: ["&fWin a &etier 7&f raid. Higher tiers have stronger bosses, better rewards and more perfect IVs on the catch. Tier 7 bosses need a strong, coordinated team: bring Cheers and your best Pokémon."]
