	quest.2DD27D9EF96E9915.title: "&6Sinnoh Legend"
	quest.2F4EE84533B045D9.quest_desc: [
		"&fThree biome mods fill the world with new forests, deserts, meadows and mountains. Each biome below is worth a visit and has its own Pokémon spawns."
