	quest.E4881E0FEF6E6C18.quest_desc: ["&fSend out a rideable Pokémon (Arcanine, Lapras, Charizard and many more) and right-click it with an empty hand to ride it. Feed it flavored Aprijuice to raise its ride stats."]
